(975, '256772627943', '256788718141', NULL, 'We are sorry for any inconveniences and frustrations caused due to the delay in delivering the package however, we are experiencing delays because the cargo planes we are using are rescheduling flights because they are opting for transporting passengers other than cargo which is affecting our delivery time \nHowever we are working tirelessly to have the items delivered as soon as possible dear. Thank you for your patience dear.', 'text', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'none', 0, NULL, 'wamid.HBgMMjU2Nzg4NzE4MTQxFQIAERgSMzEyQThCMjk2MEExNkQ0OTk1AA==', 'read', '2025-12-19 14:30:04', NULL, '2025-12-19 09:02:52', '2025-12-19 14:30:05', '2025-12-19 09:02:52', 'seen', 86, NULL, 0, '\n        <div class=\"rp-left\"></div>\n        <div class=\"rp-body\">\n            <div class=\"rp-title\">Replying to message</div>\n            <div class=\"rp-content\">Please let me know as well so that I can tell my daughter when to check in once the items are delivered. Am hoping there\'s transparency in the whole thing</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"rp-close\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-xmark\"></i></div>\n    ', NULL, '', NULL, 0, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL),
