(1, 2, 16, 'Subject: Request for Full Name as Appearing on Academic Transcripts\n\nDear Elizabeth,\n\nGood morning. I hope this message finds you well.\n\nTo facilitate the preparation of your internship acceptance letter, kindly provide your full name exactly as it appears on your academic transcripts. We would appreciate receiving this information by May 16, 2025, to ensure timely processing.\n\nThank you for your prompt attention to this matter.\n\nBest regards,\nJjuuko Deogratious\nManaging Director\nSofdas Technologies Ltd.\n📧 info@sofdas.com\n📞 +256 701 364 508 / +256 701 362 192\n🌐 www.sofdas.com', 1, 1, '2025-05-15', 'initiated'),
(2, 2, 16, 'Subject: Request for Full Name as Appearing on Academic Transcripts\n\nDear Elizabeth,\n\nGood morning. I hope this message finds you well.\n\nTo facilitate the preparation of your internship acceptance letter, kindly provide your full name exactly as it appears on your academic transcripts. We would appreciate receiving this information by May 16, 2025, to ensure timely processing.\n\nThank you for your prompt attention to this matter.\n\nBest regards,\nJjuuko Deogratious\nManaging Director\nSofdas Technologies Ltd.\n📧 info@sofdas.com\n📞 +256 701 364 508 / +256 701 362 192\n🌐 www.sofdas.com', 2, 1, '2025-05-15', 'approved'),
