(3551, '256772627943', '256753142961', NULL, 'We sincerely apologize for the delay with your order. We completely understand your frustration and the inconvenience this has caused, and we truly appreciate your patience. The festive season has been exceptionally busy, and we have experienced unexpected delays due to high volumes and extended clearance queues.\n\nThat said, please be assured that your order is a top priority for us. We are expecting a pending shipment to arrive this week, and once it is cleared and sorting is completed, we will update you immediately. Thank you so much for your understanding and continued patience 🙏🏾', 'text', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'none', 0, NULL, 'wamid.HBgMMjU2NzUzMTQyOTYxFQIAERgSRTRGMDA1RkU5RDc0MERERkNDAA==', 'read', '2025-12-21 14:39:23', NULL, '2025-12-21 14:34:04', '2025-12-21 14:39:24', '2025-12-21 14:34:04', 'seen', 81, NULL, 0, '\n        <div class=\"rp-left\"></div>\n        <div class=\"rp-body\">\n            <div class=\"rp-title\">Replying to message</div>\n            <div class=\"rp-content\" href=\"#wamid.HBgMMjU2NzUzMTQyOTYxFQIAEhggQUNFMzNGODQ0NzFCNEJDNEZFNzUxNDAwNDRBMjBERkYA\">Hey carol how are you ..I just ordered items from shein but it\'s been a month and one weeks and I just need it for my prewedding photoshoots and its for the next week</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"rp-close\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-xmark\"></i></div>\n    ', NULL, '', NULL, 0, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL),
