(5495, '256772627943', '256774688864', NULL, 'Good morning dear , Thank you for the inquiry \nKindly note that we no longer place orders for *Amazon*,*Noon*,*ASOS*,*Fashion* *Nova* *no Alibaba* or similar platforms. We now only process orders for SHEIN and Temu.\n\nHowever, you can place the order yourself and have it delivered to our Dubai shopping location. Once we receive it, we’ll handle the shipping and clearing to Uganda for you.\n\nLet me know if you need the delivery address or help with how to go about it💛', 'text', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'none', 0, NULL, 'wamid.HBgMMjU2Nzc0Njg4ODY0FQIAERgSMTlGMTJERjFDNEU3RkJBRjgxAA==', 'read', '2025-12-23 07:51:46', NULL, '2025-12-23 07:17:08', '2025-12-23 07:51:47', '2025-12-23 07:17:08', 'seen', 80, NULL, 0, '\n        <div class=\"rp-left\"></div>\n        <div class=\"rp-body\">\n            <div class=\"rp-title\">Replying to message</div>\n            <div class=\"rp-content\"></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"rp-close\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-xmark\"></i></div>\n    ', NULL, '', NULL, 0, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL),
