(6715, '971524813633', '256772627943', NULL, 'Hello, my name is Judith.\nI came across your page on TikTok and learned that you work as a personal shopper in Uganda. I thought it would be a great opportunity to reach out to you.\nI work as a transporter, delivering products from Dubai to Uganda, and I travel every week. This allows me to offer reliable and timely delivery services for different types of items.\nI would like to propose a possible collaboration. If you have customers who need items delivered from Dubai to Uganda, I would be happy to handle the transportation at an agreed fee.\nI am trustworthy, experienced, and careful with customers’ items. I believe this partnership could be beneficial to both of us and help serve your clients better.\nPlease let me know if this is something you would be interested in discussing further.\nThank you, and I look forward to hearing from you.\nKind regards,\nJudith', 'text', NULL, '', NULL, NULL, 'none', 0, NULL, 'wamid.HBgMOTcxNTI0ODEzNjMzFQIAEhggQUNCQUMzQTAyNzQ4RkI5RUU4OTQ2NDIzQzhBRDg3N0MA', 'received', NULL, NULL, '2025-12-24 03:49:16', NULL, '2025-12-24 03:49:16', 'seen', 67, NULL, 0, '', NULL, '', NULL, 0, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL),
