(8413, '256772627943', '256748125086', NULL, 'We are genuinely sorry about that but Kindly note that the release of orders at customs occurs on a random basis and is therefore beyond our direct control. \nPlease be rest assured that we are closely monitoring the process, and we will promptly reach out to you as soon as your order becomes available and ready for collection.', 'text', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'none', 0, NULL, 'wamid.HBgMMjU2NzQ4MTI1MDg2FQIAERgSM0EwNDc4MEEzQTE3NTRGQzVBAA==', 'failed', '2025-12-26 09:31:02', NULL, '2025-12-26 09:31:01', '2025-12-26 09:31:02', '2025-12-26 09:31:01', 'seen', 86, NULL, 0, '', NULL, '', NULL, 0, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL),
