(32030, '256772627943', '256705855505', NULL, 'Yes dear however once your items reach our dubai location we charge 35,000ugx per kilogram for normal cargo, 20,000ugx per perfume bottle and 50,000ugx for cameras and smart watches', 'text', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'none', 0, NULL, 'wamid.HBgMMjU2NzA1ODU1NTA1FQIAERgSNjI3MUYzNjlDNzFCNzYxRUY0AA==', 'delivered', '2026-01-06 13:36:31', NULL, '2026-01-06 13:36:30', '2026-01-06 13:36:31', '2026-01-06 13:36:30', 'seen', 86, NULL, 0, '<div class=\"rp-left\"></div>\n        <div class=\"rp-body\">\n            <div class=\"rp-title\">Replying to message</div>\n            <div class=\"rp-content\" href=\"#wamid.HBgMMjU2NzA1ODU1NTA1FQIAERgSODkzNTA2QkQwRUI0Nzg3RUQ4AA==\">Alibaba involves self ordering where you place the order yourself and have it delivered to our Dubai shopping location. Once we receive it, we’ll handle the shipping and clearing to Uganda for you.\nWe charge 35,000ugx per kilogram for normal cargo, 20,000ugx per perfume bottle and 50,000ugx for cameras and smart watches \n \nLet me know if you need the delivery address or help with how to go about it</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"rp-close\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-xmark\"></i></div>', NULL, '', NULL, 0, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL),
