(40706, '256772627943', '256774033380', NULL, 'Kindly note that SHEIN orders typically arrive within 2–3 weeks. However, due to the current uncertainty surrounding the Uganda elections, which has resulted in transportation disruptions and logistical delays across key transit routes, we have adjusted the expected delivery timeframe to approximately 4 weeks.', 'text', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'none', 0, NULL, 'wamid.HBgMMjU2Nzc0MDMzMzgwFQIAERgSMTM2MDZDNzAwRTg3RTg4MkQ3AA==', 'delivered', '2026-01-08 20:05:21', NULL, '2026-01-08 20:05:20', '2026-01-08 20:05:22', '2026-01-08 20:05:20', 'seen', 81, NULL, 0, '<div class=\"rp-left\"></div>\n        <div class=\"rp-body\">\n            <div class=\"rp-title\">Replying to message</div>\n            <div class=\"rp-content\" href=\"#wamid.HBgMMjU2Nzc0MDMzMzgwFQIAEhggQUM3MjdFNkY4RDE2MUVDMDI1MjQwNDBGNjlEOEQxRjEA\">I would like to order some clothes from shein.\nSo i would like to know, \n- How long does it take for them to get to uganda?\n- I am a size 16....how do i know that size wit shein clothes? Is it L or XL.\n- Do i choose my own clothes n i share the cart with you or i have to come to you to choose my songs?</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"rp-close\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-xmark\"></i></div>', NULL, '', NULL, 0, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL),
