(41968, '256785700880', '256772627943', NULL, 'Happy 5th Anniversary, Hilary and Carol!\n\nAs you celebrate five years of marriage, I thank God for the privilege of having stood with you on the day you became one. It is a joy to see how your love has grown through every season.\n\nEcclesiastes 4:12: “Though one may be overpowered, two can defend themselves. A cord of three strands is not quickly broken.”  \n\nAlways keep God at the center of your marriage, choose love even on difficult days, listen to understand, forgive quickly, and never stop praying together. Let friendship remain the foundation of your union.\n\nMay the Lord bless your home with peace, wisdom, and enduring love. Here’s to many more beautiful years ahead. Happy Anniversary!', 'text', NULL, '', NULL, NULL, 'none', 0, NULL, 'wamid.HBgMMjU2Nzg1NzAwODgwFQIAEhggQUMxMDJFQTBCNUYwOUFBMUJGRjkxRkMxQTMwM0Y2NTEA', 'received', NULL, NULL, '2026-01-09 10:18:28', NULL, '2026-01-09 10:18:28', 'seen', 80, NULL, 0, '', NULL, '', NULL, 0, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL),
