(46293, '256772627943', '256782062222', NULL, 'Thank you for your response. We’ve received the details and will review them internally. We’ll revert to you once the review is complete.', 'text', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'none', 0, NULL, 'wamid.HBgMMjU2NzgyMDYyMjIyFQIAERgSQzFCMThBNkRDODZFOERCRjFFAA==', 'read', '2026-01-10 15:18:12', NULL, '2026-01-10 15:10:24', '2026-01-10 15:18:13', '2026-01-10 15:10:24', 'seen', 80, NULL, 0, '<div class=\"rp-left\"></div>\n        <div class=\"rp-body\">\n            <div class=\"rp-title\">Replying to message</div>\n            <div class=\"rp-content\" href=\"#wamid.HBgMMjU2NzgyMDYyMjIyFQIAEhgUM0FCMzQ4RTUzQTg4RkRFMDIwRDIA\">Absolutely \nFor this campaign, here’s what I propose:\n	•	Deliverables: 1 TikTok feed post + 1 Instagram feed post, plus 3 bonus Instagram posts\n	•	Fee: 3,000,000 UGX\n	•	Post Duration: Posts will remain live on my profiles for a minimum of 3 months\n	•	Usage: This is a posting and tagging collaboration only. Content will not be downloaded, reposted, or used elsewhere unless agreed upon separately\n\nBecause items need to be ordered in advance (which can take up to 2 weeks), I require a 50% deposit upfront before starting the collaboration. The remaining 50% can be settled once the posts are live.\n\nPlease let me know if this works for you, and we can get the process started.\n\nLooking forward to creating some great content together</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"rp-close\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-xmark\"></i></div>', NULL, '', NULL, 0, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL),
