(47331, '256772627943', '256786209010', NULL, 'Thank you so much for asking, it\'s completely understandable to want clarity before proceeding 🤍\n\nPlease be assured that your money is safe with us. If for any reason all the items you ordered are not available or cannot be brought, you will be fully refunded for any item not delivered. We do not hold customers’ money unfairly.', 'text', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'none', 0, NULL, 'wamid.HBgMMjU2Nzg2MjA5MDEwFQIAERgSN0QxODMyQzgxQ0FFNzJCMUI0AA==', 'read', '2026-01-11 10:52:12', NULL, '2026-01-11 08:35:57', '2026-01-11 10:52:13', '2026-01-11 08:35:57', 'seen', 81, NULL, 0, '<div class=\"rp-left\"></div>\n        <div class=\"rp-body\">\n            <div class=\"rp-title\">Replying to message</div>\n            <div class=\"rp-content\" href=\"#wamid.HBgMMjU2Nzg2MjA5MDEwFQIAEhggQUNGQTNFQzZGQjRFMkU5Q0VEMzY3M0MzMDVBNEY3MUMA\">What assurance do I get that I will get my items or what happens if all the items I ordered  for have not been brought,  do you refund the money or.... bambi I just want to be sure before I proceed</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"rp-close\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-xmark\"></i></div>', NULL, '', NULL, 0, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(47333, '256772627943', '256786209010', NULL, 'Before purchase, we also do our best to confirm item availability. In cases where something becomes unavailable unexpectedly, we will inform you immediately, and you can choose to:\n\nReceive a refund for the unavailable item, or\n\nReplace it with another item of your choice.\n\nOur goal is to build trust and ensure you’re satisfied every step of the way. If you have any other concerns, please feel free to ask—I’m happy to clarify.', 'text', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'none', 0, NULL, 'wamid.HBgMMjU2Nzg2MjA5MDEwFQIAERgSQThEMzFDNjQxQkIwMTZDREREAA==', 'read', '2026-01-11 10:52:12', NULL, '2026-01-11 08:36:42', '2026-01-11 10:52:13', '2026-01-11 08:36:42', 'seen', 81, NULL, 0, '<div class=\"rp-left\"></div>\n        <div class=\"rp-body\">\n            <div class=\"rp-title\">Replying to message</div>\n            <div class=\"rp-content\" href=\"#wamid.HBgMMjU2Nzg2MjA5MDEwFQIAEhggQUNGQTNFQzZGQjRFMkU5Q0VEMzY3M0MzMDVBNEY3MUMA\">What assurance do I get that I will get my items or what happens if all the items I ordered  for have not been brought,  do you refund the money or.... bambi I just want to be sure before I proceed</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"rp-close\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-xmark\"></i></div>', NULL, '', NULL, 0, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL),
