(47851, '256772627943', '256706152793', NULL, 'And if they weight more than a kg \nEg if they weigh 4.53kgs then you pay\n4.53kgs*35,000=158,550 ugx\n158,550 ugx would be the charge dear', 'text', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'none', 0, NULL, 'wamid.HBgMMjU2NzA2MTUyNzkzFQIAERgSMEQ1RjdENkJCM0VFMTlENUJGAA==', 'delivered', '2026-01-11 13:12:25', NULL, '2026-01-11 13:12:24', '2026-01-11 13:12:26', '2026-01-11 13:12:24', 'seen', 81, NULL, 0, '<div class=\"rp-left\"></div>\n        <div class=\"rp-body\">\n            <div class=\"rp-title\">Replying to message</div>\n            <div class=\"rp-content\" href=\"#wamid.HBgMMjU2NzA2MTUyNzkzFQIAEhgUM0FENjg1NjMzM0U3QkI3NjUwQUQA\">How would they be billed?\n50k only or 50k plus the weight of the console?</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"rp-close\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-xmark\"></i></div>', NULL, '', NULL, 0, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL),
