(6767, '2023-10-04 18:18:20', 50, 1, 0, 3, 'daks couriers \r\nthe transport manager scheduled an appointment so i can talk more with him. thats on tuesday \r\n\r\ncipro freight \r\ni hope and prospect business \r\n\r\nCSEC iintend to visit it with Madam Cathy tomorow or friday '),
