(6799, '2023-10-11 17:50:13', 50, 1, 0, 2, 'Cipro freight is still in need of more details to understand our tyres so am doing the convincing terms \r\nmeanwhile they are interested \r\n\r\nbusoga university is promising business next month when they get a fleet procured by the ministry '),
