(6999, '2023-11-16 16:52:39', 50, 1, 0, 3, '1. visited Mr. Fortunate to discuss more about the prices and requested for discount but he wanted this so i decided to make an analysis to find out his demand in quantity weekly so that discount can happen \r\n2. Visited Mr. Ibra and we tried getting an appointment with his boss to present my proposal physically \r\n3. visited San Transporters and they are promising so will keep in touch with Mr. Ssemakula for business '),
(7000, '2023-11-16 16:52:39', 50, 2, 0, 3, 'ambiance distillers \r\nhenhar services \r\nAsante waste management '),
(7001, '2023-11-16 18:07:45', 22, 1, 0, 3, '1 Ntake ...took there missing invoice  \r\n2. Ivanos/promised a bigger order soon \r\n3. Praise distributors/ still pushing thou promising.'),
(7002, '2023-11-16 18:22:41', 16, 1, 0, 1, '1.UGANDA TODAY Talked to Micheal. He said that he is going to sit down and calculate our wheel alignment and balance rates when rates when all goes well He will get back to me.'),
(7003, '2023-11-16 18:22:41', 16, 2, 0, 4, '1.ELLIGNTON Mr. Kintu had promised to come today at office but I have been trying to contact him he did not give me any feedback yet he read my WhatsApp messages. Therefore I have given him time to sort himself\r\n2.MASH Tried to call Mr. Abed but he did not pick\r\n3.VITAFOAM Sent a payment reminder to Mr. Blaj He has not yet replied\r\n4.ERAM UGANDA LTD Sent a message to Peter but he has not yet replied'),
(7004, '2023-11-16 18:35:51', 14, 1, 0, 2, 'i have Visited Dei group office in Ggaba to egage them about tyres\r\n\r\nI have visited BLd at Salama road to take them quotations\r\n'),
(7005, '2023-11-16 18:37:44', 14, 1, 0, 2, 'i have Visited Dei group office in Ggaba to egage them about tyres\r\n\r\nI have visited BLd at Salama road to take them quotations\r\n'),
(7006, '2023-11-16 18:38:43', 14, 1, 0, 2, 'i have Visited Dei group office in Ggaba to egage them about tyres\r\n\r\nI have visited BLd at Salama road to take them quotations\r\n'),
(7007, '2023-11-16 18:39:17', 14, 1, 0, 2, 'I have Visited Dei group office in Ggaba to egage them about tyres\r\n\r\nI have visited BLd at Salama road to take them quotations\r\n'),
(7008, '2023-11-16 18:39:17', 14, 2, 0, 2, 'I have called Arthur Oil palm kalangala to engage about the quotations\r\n\r\nI have Call Samuel of Sogea to follow up on the invoices'),
(7009, '2023-11-16 18:39:17', 14, 3, 0, 1, 'Sold 2pcs of 205/70/R15'),
(7010, '2023-11-16 18:39:17', 14, 124, 0, 1, 'from Oil palm'),
(7011, '2023-11-17 18:09:21', 50, 1, 0, 3, '1. Visited Asante waste management in kitintale and they have a medium fleet of light trucks that collect rubbish and waste. Mr. Meddy the procurement manager made his questions and i had a discussion with him and visited his fleet. I believe we will make business soon. \r\n2. Atlas cargo limited but I did not get chance to talk to the procurement manager but will keep calling in and trying. \r\n3. Securex limited and Mr. Andrew the transport manager told me they still have auditing issues but will make a purchase soon as they are over it because a number of his trucks are not moving.'),
(7012, '2023-11-20 17:33:52', 50, 1, 0, 4, '1. Ntake bakery we had to visit them with manager and the team to change account handlers \r\n2. Ambiance distillers to check on their financial statement so we can make it possible \r\n3. Denovo bakery'),
(7013, '2023-11-20 17:33:52', 50, 2, 0, 5, '1. AJ tours and travels for an appointment\r\n2. Mr. Fortunate to schedule to meet with the boss to discuss price terms \r\n3. Henhar services but their was no response \r\n4. Premier distillers should check on Mr Avinash to see if he is ready to offer me business\r\n5. Mr Ibra of KM investments also promised to meet with his boss this week '),
(7014, '2023-11-20 17:34:49', 14, 1, 0, 5, 'We have Visited Ambiance Distillers \r\n\r\nwe have visited NTAKE bakery \r\n\r\nWe have visited home pride bakery\r\n\r\nWe have visited Denevo bakery\r\n\r\nWe have visited Kiddawalime bakery'),
(7015, '2023-11-20 17:34:49', 14, 2, 0, 2, 'Called Arthur of Oil Palm to forward on the qoutations\r\n\r\nI have called Leading distillers to check on the order promised'),
(7016, '2023-11-20 17:34:49', 14, 9, 0, 3, ' Went Ndeeba\r\n\r\nwent to Nalukolongo\r\n\r\nwent to Kikajjo'),
(7017, '2023-11-20 17:53:12', 22, 1, 0, 3, '1. ntake bakery 2. davena 3. home pride '),
(7018, '2023-11-20 17:53:12', 22, 2, 0, 3, '1. Julius ntake/ asked to see me this week 2. Boaz trinity/ he said our lpo will go threu this week 3. dan Bukola/ they will not buy i finally give up on them.'),
(7019, '2023-11-20 17:53:12', 22, 9, 0, 3, '1. ntake bakery 2. Deneva 3. home pride'),
(7020, '2023-11-20 17:34:49', 16, 2, 0, 2, '.'),
(7021, '2023-11-21 16:05:55', 50, 1, 0, 3, '1. AJ tours and travels i called them but the manaeger siad his out of office becuase of some trips but soon as his back he will give me an appointment. So i intend to keep calling him to get it.\r\n2. Henhar services they happened to not be in office and i called Mr. Jack he promised me an appointment\r\n3. Visited Ambiance distillers to talk to Madam Stella about chnages in the accounts handling. \r\n'),
(7022, '2023-11-21 16:05:55', 50, 2, 0, 2, '1. Mr. Avinash of premier distillers \r\n2. Mr. Brian of east african roofings ltd \r\n'),
(7023, '2023-11-21 18:08:54', 16, 1, 0, 2, '1.VIVA Ssalongo told me that he is trying to look for money. when he gets it they will pay electronically\r\n2.UBOS Mr. Charles was out of office He said he will notify me when in office\r\n'),
(7024, '2023-11-21 18:08:54', 16, 2, 0, 4, '1.TENTS 4 U Mr. Pius was contacted but he did not answer my calls\r\n2.KYERIMA HARDWARE Talked to the manager but he said he is out of office but promised to call me back\r\n3.ZERIPEN Manager Derrick had promised to give me feedback last week that is why I had to contact him today but he did not pick. I have to persist and go there physically\r\n4.KYENGERA AUTOGARAGE The manager said that he will need 275/75r16 after repairing the vehicle soon'),
(7025, '2023-11-22 17:50:52', 16, 1, 0, 3, '1.LANDROVER NSAMBYA Met Mr. Hamil assistant manager. He said he will call me incase of any need of tyres\r\n2.LADDER MINISTRIES Talked to Mr. Odongo and he said he will call me incase of any need for tyres\r\n3.VIVA Ssalongo said that they are trying to look for money but things are hard these three days'),
(7026, '2023-11-22 17:50:52', 16, 2, 0, 2, '1.KIIWA HARDWARE The manager asked me to call him tomorrow to give me feedback from the procurement\r\n2.ROKO Mr. Bakka said that we should take samples and present them to the transport and mechanic manager for approval'),
(7027, '2023-11-22 17:51:50', 50, 1, 0, 4, '1. Asante waste management Mr. Meddy failed to make it for the set appointment and no response from him on phone. \r\n2. Mr. Aviansh of premier distillers called me and said we should meet and talk more so I am to reschedule again to meet him next week. \r\n3. AJ tours and travels but did not meet the manager again \r\n4. East African roofings but Mr. Brian claims no need yet so am still picking on him.'),
(7028, '2023-11-22 18:17:32', 22, 1, 0, 3, '1. trinity express/ they are working on our cheque 2. praise distributors/ still promising 3. Hana water/ they have a new manager so jamil will try them out'),
(7029, '2023-11-22 18:17:32', 22, 9, 0, 3, '1. hana water 2. praise distrubtors 3. trinity express'),
(7030, '2023-11-23 18:16:20', 22, 1, 0, 3, '1.hest engineers 2. trinity express 3. Bana enterprises'),
(7031, '2023-11-23 18:16:20', 22, 9, 0, 3, '1. trinity 2. Bana enterprises 3. Hest engineers'),
(7032, '2023-11-23 18:17:04', 16, 1, 0, 1, '1.PEC The logistics manager welcomed my proposal. He promised to present it to the management. He also promised to give me feedback soon.'),
(7033, '2023-11-23 18:17:04', 16, 2, 0, 4, '1.ZHANGS Tried to contact Tito but he did not pick\r\n2.GOLDEN MARKETING Mr. Kakaire asked me to go back next week and talk to the boss\r\n3.WONDERFOAM Mr. Wabwire did not pick my calls\r\n4.MASH PAO Paid 980000 and cleared the account'),
(7034, '2023-11-23 18:17:04', 16, 5, 0, 1, '1.KINKIZI TRADERS The manager asked me to call him on Monday in the morning'),
(7035, '2023-11-24 18:55:54', 16, 1, 0, 1, '1.MASH They told me to go back on Monday'),
(7036, '2023-11-24 18:55:54', 16, 2, 0, 3, '1.SIGHT SAVERS They told me i call them back on 15th December\r\n2.IVAN TOURS He said he will come to office\r\n3.KIBOKO They do not need tyres at the moment'),
(7037, '2023-11-27 17:57:15', 50, 1, 0, 4, '1. Meeting with Mr. Jotham and we discussed and exchanged accounts with him i expect business soon \r\n2. Ambiance distillers made a cheque to clear the debt. Meet with Stella and we talked on how to keep the account active and ho worders flow. \r\n3. Home pride bakery also Mr Jotham also made an appointment for me with the InCharge i hope it will be soon. \r\n4. Mr. Brian of east African roofings also wanted a quotation of 265/70R17.5 and i hope to proceed with the order '),
(7038, '2023-11-27 17:58:07', 50, 1, 0, 4, '1. Meeting with Mr. Jotham and we discussed and exchanged accounts with him I expect business soon \r\n2. Ambiance distillers made a cheque to clear the debt. Meet with Stella and we talked on how to keep the account active and ho worders flow. \r\n3. Home pride bakery also Mr. Jotham also made an appointment for me with the InCharge i hope it will be soon. \r\n4. Mr. Brian of east African roofings also wanted a quotation of 265/70R17.5 and i hope to proceed with the order '),
(7039, '2023-11-27 17:58:07', 50, 2, 0, 2, '1. Mr. Fortunate made an order but it bounced too for 13r22.5 \r\n2. called Mr. Avinash and he was busy we did not talk a lot so will call him or visit him soon \r\n'),
(7040, '2023-11-27 17:58:07', 50, 3, 0, 1, '1. Ambiance ordered for 7.00R15 lt and was delivered well '),
(7041, '2023-11-27 18:21:05', 16, 1, 0, 2, '1.MASH Mr Abed said that they want linglong in 315/80r22.5. I also talked to Musa. He requested for a quotation of 385/65r22.5 supersingle\r\n2.VITAFOAM Delivered 6pieces of tyres 9.5r17.5 4pcs and 700r16 2pcs'),
(7042, '2023-11-27 18:21:05', 16, 2, 0, 4, '1.HAJATI MAYI The manager said that the driver changed tyres from Kibuye\r\n2.MUKIIBI TOURS Contacted Mr Mukiibi but he did not pick\r\n3.KIDDAWALIME Contacted the procurement officer and he said he will call me back\r\n4.VIVA Sent Ssalongo the balance of VIVA account am still waiting for feedback from him'),
(7043, '2023-11-27 18:38:21', 22, 1, 0, 4, '1. home pride 2. ivanos 3. ntake bakery/ was introducing jamil to the decision makers 4. trinity express/ our cheque has not yet arrived.'),
(7044, '2023-11-27 18:38:21', 22, 9, 0, 4, '1. ntake bakery2. ivanos 3. home pride 4. trinity express.'),
(7045, '2023-11-28 18:06:41', 16, 1, 0, 2, '1.BCR Mr. Rwaboni asked me to check on him in the 1st week of January 2024\r\n2.VIVA Madam Sumayiah told me to go back on Thursday for cash payment'),
(7046, '2023-11-28 18:06:41', 16, 2, 0, 4, '1.CHINA RAILWAY Contacted the manager but he did not answer my calls\r\n2.BCL Bugoloobi Mr Shayam said that they will give us business when they get money\r\n3.HIGHWAY COACHES Contacted Mr Ronald about their balance. He said he will contact Micheal the current manager to sort that issue\r\n4.DAFRIC bought two tyres Rodeo 195r15c'),
(7047, '2023-11-28 18:06:41', 16, 3, 0, 1, '2pcs Rodeo 195r15c'),
(7048, '2023-11-28 18:06:41', 16, 10, 0, 2, '2pcs Rodeo 195r15c'),
(7049, '2023-11-28 18:12:29', 50, 1, 0, 4, '1.Visited Mr Katumba and he was not in office but i later called him for an appointment again \r\n2. Tyson tractors in Mengo but Mr Tyson told me he needs to look through our prices \r\n3. Baros transport but there fleet is getting new Tyres next month so i will keep in touch with him soon \r\n4 Mr. Gerald called me of mother care schools and he promised orders soon for his fleet when they close school '),
(7050, '2023-11-28 18:12:29', 50, 2, 0, 2, 'Africa logistics \r\nHome to Africa tours and travels '),
(7051, '2023-11-29 17:01:25', 14, 1, 0, 3, 'I have Visited Ministry of Gender to follow up on their request for quotation\r\n\r\nI have visited Daneva to follow up on them\r\n\r\nI have Visited Denovo Bakery to check if they have any order however Mulangira promised to contact in case of any requirement.'),
(7052, '2023-11-29 17:01:26', 14, 2, 0, 3, 'Called Vicky Oil palm Buvuma to follow up on the tyr inquiries she had made \r\n\r\nI have called Samuel Sogea to check on the order he had promised\r\n\r\nI have called Patrick at Globe Trotters to follow up on the debt'),
(7053, '2023-11-29 17:01:26', 14, 9, 0, 3, 'Kinawa \r\n\r\nNalukolongo and Nakasero'),
(7054, '2023-11-29 17:01:26', 14, 124, 0, 1, '16.9 30 tyres to Oil Palm Buvuma'),
(7055, '2023-11-29 17:30:24', 50, 1, 0, 3, '1. Mr Brian of East African roofings to talk about the recent quotation. He is not okay with the price so he will talk to logistics officer to confirm. \r\n2. Mr. Ibra of KM investments and he made me sure we shall be there first priority incase the resume business\r\n3. Mother care schools and talked to Mr. Gerald he will need some Tyres soon \r\n'),
(7056, '2023-11-29 17:30:24', 50, 2, 0, 3, '1. Called Snowman and they were not answering \r\n2. Britam Insurance but they did not give me an appointment \r\n3. Kyambadde of kijambu hardware of matugga and he promised business soon for his new trucks '),
(7057, '2023-11-29 18:11:25', 16, 1, 0, 3, '1.ZERIPEN Manager Derrick was not in office\r\n2.ELLINGTON the manager had went abroad but he is coming back next week and he promised to buy tyres\r\n3.AGRO CORNER Manager Richard was not in office'),
(7058, '2023-11-29 18:11:26', 16, 2, 0, 4, '1.HEAVY INVESTMENTS Mr. Jagwe wants 31X10.50r15 but he said he will get back to me soon\r\n2.SMART FLOORS they did not pick\r\n3.SSEWABIGA TRANSPORTERS He wants another tyre of 225/55r17\r\n4.ZINDA He went to the field and he is not yet back'),
(7059, '2023-11-29 18:15:17', 22, 1, 0, 5, '1.praise distributors/ they are promising business. I am going to introduce Jamil to them 2.boaz trinity/ promising orders 3.hest engineers I will take Jamil to meet them 4.trinity/ I will take Jamil there 5.bana enterprises musa was out of office'),
(7060, '2023-11-30 17:26:21', 50, 1, 0, 3, '1. Snowmans limited met with them and they made an appointment for me with the InCharge of transport and we exchanged contacts \r\n2. Mr. Tyson of Tyson tractors told me he will make an order soon \r\n3. Supa loaf bakery but did not meet the InCharge so they told me to return on Monday when his in office next week '),
(7061, '2023-11-30 17:26:21', 50, 2, 0, 2, 'ambiance distillers and they made an order of 195R15c for drone \r\nAvinash of premier distillers but no answer \r\n'),
(7062, '2023-11-30 17:26:21', 50, 3, 0, 1, '2 pieces of 195R15c Rodeo for Ambiance distillers '),
(7063, '2023-11-30 17:26:57', 14, 1, 0, 3, 'I have gone to Canlet to inspect Fr. Peters car that needs tyres\r\n\r\nI have gone to ministry of gender\r\n\r\nI have gone to Dooba Enterprises'),
(7064, '2023-11-30 17:26:57', 14, 2, 0, 2, ' I have called Denevo bakery and Vicky oil palm Buvuma'),
(7065, '2023-11-30 17:37:15', 16, 1, 0, 2, '1.IRC Mr Katumba asked me to submit my proposal\r\n2.VIVA Will try them on Saturday'),
(7066, '2023-11-30 17:37:16', 16, 2, 0, 2, '1.JIT He said that  he is coming next week to see our brands\r\n2.VITAFOAM The HR said he is going to push payment'),
(7067, '2023-12-01 18:34:57', 16, 1, 0, 2, '1.KINKIZI TRADERS Bought 2pcs of 225/65r17\r\n2.ZHANGZ Tito told me to check on him on Wednesday next week'),
(7068, '2023-12-01 18:34:58', 16, 2, 0, 1, '1.GOLDEN MARKETING Mr. Kakaire told me to go back on Thursday'),
(7069, '2023-12-01 18:34:58', 16, 3, 0, 2, '2pcs of  Bearway 225/65r17 to Kinkizi Traders'),
(7070, '2023-12-04 18:27:36', 50, 1, 0, 2, '1.Mr Kyambadde of kijambu hardware promised to check on his trucks and compile the necessary needed tyres \r\n2. Homepride bakery and met the procurement officer. '),
(7071, '2023-12-04 18:27:36', 50, 2, 0, 2, '1. Ibra of KM investments but he did not respond \r\n2. Homeklin waste management gave me an appointment for tuesday '),
(7072, '2023-12-05 17:43:07', 50, 1, 0, 2, '1. Ambiance distillers we visited them with manager to talk to madam stella \r\n2. Based contractors a new company i brought on board today i will visit them on friday and make sure i see the company fleet like loaders and trucks '),
(7073, '2023-12-05 17:43:07', 50, 2, 0, 3, '1. Fortunate of tbbl but he did not have any response \r\n2. KM investments but Mr Ibra did not answer the calls all day \r\n3. Jotham of Ntake bakery but no response '),
(7074, '2023-12-05 17:43:07', 50, 3, 0, 1, 'ambiance distillers bought 195R15C for drone of 3 pieces '),
(7075, '2023-12-05 17:55:24', 16, 1, 0, 3, '1. ZERIPEN . Manager derrick is in exams . So the person I met told me wait for him till 20th\r\n2.MASH. MUSA asked me to contact Abed in Kenya. Abed asked me to send him pics for 315/80r22.5 and the price\r\n3.VIVA. Has paid 2million'),
(7076, '2023-12-05 17:55:24', 16, 2, 0, 3, '1.VITAFOAM BALAJI promised an order for tyres tomorrow and he said that this week will arrange payment\r\n2.KAFIIKA The number was not going through\r\n3.KIDDAWALIME wants 700r15 MRF. if possible he wants to know the price'),
(7077, '2023-12-05 17:55:24', 16, 8, 0, 1, 'VIVA 2million'),
(7078, '2023-12-06 17:58:24', 50, 1, 0, 3, '1. Isvert limited the manager was not in office so i rescheduled with him and he gave me the transport managers contact who i called and promised to meet too.\r\n2. Home Klin called me but they were inquiring about our services offered so i shared our catalog and company profile. we shall meet tomorrow \r\n3. Ntake bakery Mr. Jotham is not collaborating with me as for now so i am not prospective of business any sooner '),
(7079, '2023-12-06 18:31:25', 16, 1, 0, 3, '1.ELLINGTON SAFARIS They had ordered for 235/75r15 for drone. when they brought it at office. The technician said that the size would not work on it. They had an option of 225/75r15 but they did not like the tread so they cancelled the order\r\n2.DAFRIC LOGISTICS Gerald said that he is going to come within 2 days from now for 206r16 2pcs after repairing the truck\r\n3.ERAM UGANDA LIMITED Peter said that they will arrange a meeting for purchases after the on going construction of their building. He therefore asked me to check on him in January'),
(7080, '2023-12-06 18:31:25', 16, 2, 0, 3, '1.VITAFOAM Bought 2tyres 195/70r14 and 700r15\r\n2.RCL requested for a price quote of 245/70r16 for 4pcs. I will try to push this account\r\n3.ZHANGZ Titos number was not available'),
(7081, '2023-12-06 18:31:25', 16, 3, 0, 2, '1pc 700r15 and 1pc habilead 195/70r14'),
(7082, '2023-12-07 17:08:28', 50, 1, 0, 2, '1. TBBL to see the manager with madam Cathy but he had an emergency and was not  in office we intend to meet he on Tuesday next week.\r\n2. Buildmax we met the transport manager in mpererwe Mr Ssemakula and he promised to make an appointment with the logistics at there office next week ');
INSERT INTO `checklist_response` (`checklist_response_id`, `date`, `user_id`, `checklist_id`, `client_id`, `value`, `narration`) VALUES
(7083, '2023-12-07 18:19:26', 16, 1, 0, 4, '1.KINTOGO TOURS The director promised to give us business. She shared her contacts\r\n2.ZABEETO CACTAS Hajji said that he will come to office next week\r\n3.BWEBALE COACHES Mr. Jimmy said that the tyres he took  two of them disappointed him in two days. He says that the problem could be on tubes probably due to factory error\r\n4.ROKO Talked to Simon. He said he is going to present our brands to the mechanics. He promised to give me feedback after the meeting'),
(7084, '2023-12-07 18:19:26', 16, 2, 0, 3, '1.VITAFOAM The accountant asked me to give her two days to arrange payments for invoices overdue\r\n2.VITAFOAM JOSEPH He said that he will need 2pcs of 185/70r14 next week.\r\n3.CHINA GEO Sent a message to manager Tang to see if he can give me any order. He has not replied yet'),
(7085, '2023-12-08 18:01:52', 50, 1, 0, 3, '1. Ntake bakery but failed to meet Mr Jotham again. I hope to see him on monday next week \r\n2. Newmans industries in kikajjo though did not see the manager so i will push there on monday after ntake \r\n3. Homeklin waste management in makindye had a brief meeting with the manager and he said we shall meet once again.'),
(7086, '2023-12-08 18:01:52', 50, 4, 0, 1, '1. Ambiance distillers for 215/75R19.5 but had non in stock and bounced '),
(7087, '2023-12-08 18:08:08', 14, 1, 0, 2, 'I have gone to Ministry of Gender  to follow up on the DEBT recovery\r\n\r\nI have gone to Denevo Bakery to check for any possible order'),
(7088, '2023-12-08 18:08:08', 14, 2, 0, 2, 'I have called Arthur of Oil Palm \r\n\r\nI have called Samuel of Sogea'),
(7089, '2023-12-08 18:08:08', 14, 9, 0, 2, 'Kampala Central\r\n\r\nKinawa at denovo bakery'),
(7090, '2023-12-08 18:51:41', 16, 1, 0, 3, '1. MASH They want 12pieces of 315/80r22.5\r\n2.RIMA Mr. Herman told me to go back on Tuesday\r\n3.KREAM EVENTS They want tyres but they told me to wait until when the transport manager is back so I am going there on Tuesday\r\n'),
(7091, '2023-12-08 18:51:42', 16, 2, 0, 3, '1.HIGHWAY Micheal did not pick my call. Ronald told me He will call me back on regards to their debt\r\n2.VIVA I will go there tomorrow on regards to their debt\r\n3.TAHFEEZ TOURS AND TRAVEL Mr. Ibra said he will call me back\r\n'),
(7092, '2023-12-09 16:02:02', 16, 1, 0, 2, '1.VIVA cheque collection of 13400000\r\n2.TOURISM UGANDA LIMITED The manager promised to come to office next week'),
(7093, '2023-12-11 17:23:26', 14, 1, 0, 2, 'I have Visited Denevo Bakery to see Mulangira for any available order\r\n\r\nI have visited  Kiddawalime Bakery but was not able to see the Boss However i have been tipped to see him on thursday morning'),
(7094, '2023-12-11 17:23:26', 14, 2, 0, 2, 'I have called Samuel of Sogea to check on any possible order\r\n\r\nI have called Vicky Of oil palm Buvuma tocheck for any possible order\r\n\r\nI have called Arthur Oil Palm to make appointment with him on wedneday to meet his Boss in Office'),
(7095, '2023-12-11 17:23:26', 14, 9, 0, 2, 'Kikajjo and Natete'),
(7096, '2023-12-11 17:27:58', 50, 1, 0, 3, '1. Ntake bakery but Mr. Jotham claimed of being busy so he said he will meet us when he makes time off his schedule.\r\n2. Homepride bakery but i failed to see the manager since he was not in office by the time i got there. Therefore i intend to see him tomorrow. \r\n3. Homeklin waste management asked for prie lists and company prodile via email which i shared so i intend to hear from them soon. '),
