(7101, '2023-12-12 16:45:59', 50, 1, 0, 3, '1. Km investments with Mr Ibra unfortunately they postponed business opening till next year. He is hopeful to start next year so we wait positively \r\n2. Newmans industries were not so clear on who there current supplier is but they have a number of vehicles so will keep trying there offices till i get a better response from them. \r\n3. Kings schools closed this term but are willing and promising to send their fleet next term for new tyres '),
