(7104, '2023-12-12 17:07:24', 16, 2, 0, 5, '1.SSEWABIGA TRANSPORTERS Mr. Fred said he is coming today to clear his balance\r\n2.KIDDAWALIME JINJA Mr. Agaba said that they are going to try our brands starting with January 2024\r\n3.VITAFOAM Contacted the madam in accounts several times but she did not pick. But when I tried the MD he told me that they are working on it\r\n4.HIGHWAY BUS I contacted Ronald and they said that they are working on it\r\n5.KAFIIKA Sent James a message via WhatsApp so I am still waiting to hear from him'),
(7105, '2023-12-13 16:40:28', 50, 1, 0, 3, '1. Mr Fortunate of TBBL was not in office so i will try again another day \r\n2. Visited Exem construction company in kajansi and i shared contacts and price lists with the company manager\r\n3. Elite schools also promised to send their fleet for new tyres in the new year before school opens '),
