(7222, '2024-01-22 16:19:45', 16, 1, 0, 2, 'PEC Met Mr. Kitumba. He asked me to give him time to complete his duties and then he will share their requirements with me\r\n\r\nSIGHT SAVERS Madam Tabitha said that they do not have need for tyres at the moment But she promised to get back to me'),
(7223, '2024-01-22 16:19:45', 16, 2, 0, 3, 'KIDDAWALIME Tried to contact Rukika to request for an appointment but unfortunately the call was made busy. I will look for their address and go there direct\r\n\r\nHARUS The receptionist asked me to do to the county office physically\r\n\r\nBOLLORE Madam Deness said that I need to first get an appointment to go there. She promised to share with me transport managers number to schedule an appointment'),
(7224, '2024-01-22 17:02:19', 50, 1, 0, 3, '1. Ambiance distillers to get some orders but Stella was not in office \r\n2. Kyelima hardware the manager was not in office so i will meet with him when he calls me again \r\n3. bebeto coaches a new bus company in mengo we met with the manager Mr Okit and we intend to continue with the partnership and we will be his suppliers when they start business hence on tuesday of this week'),
(7225, '2024-01-22 17:02:19', 50, 2, 0, 1, '1. Kenlom chemicals to get clarity about the recent order to provide an invoice before delivery as delayed '),
(7226, '2024-01-22 17:02:19', 50, 3, 0, 1, '1. ntake bakery to deliver a supply of 30 Tyres as ordered on Saturday in the quoted LPO '),
