(7228, '2024-01-23 17:04:57', 16, 2, 0, 5, 'KIBOKO I wanted to talk to Mr. Abshek but I could not because he was busy. I decided to talk to his assistant Nuton. He romised to call me when need arises\r\n\r\nCHINA GEO Sent manager Tang a message but he has not yet replied but I am trying to push him into business\r\n\r\nCOUNTRY VIEW DRIVING SCHOOL Mr. Tamale asked me to call him in the evening because he had a class to attend during day time\r\n\r\nZINDA TRANSPORTER Bought 265/70r19.5 1pc\r\n\r\nMALTESSER INTERNATIONAL This tome madam Josephine picked up. She said they expect to release a bid this coming month'),
