(7233, '2024-01-23 17:15:38', 50, 1, 0, 2, '1. Mr Okit of Bebeto coaches we met and had a discussion on when orders will come in and he prospects next week or later because they just started travelling \r\n2. KM investments to see Mr Ibra on the supply deal for 315/70R22.5 for his trailers. He asked for a price list and will present it to his bosses. '),
(7234, '2024-01-23 17:15:38', 50, 2, 0, 1, '1. Ambiance distillers to check on the debt recovery but no response. Orders stillare not coming in from them because most of their fleet is still not moving as yet. But they promised some as soon as possible \r\n2. Jowas enterprises but failed to reach the manager will try them again '),
