(7236, '2024-01-24 17:45:09', 16, 1, 0, 1, 'PIN TRAVEL Talked to Mr. Gadafi. He said that he will come for 185/70r14 on 27/1/24'),
(7237, '2024-01-24 17:45:09', 16, 2, 0, 4, 'CHINA GEO Manager Tang wants tyres but at a discount price. I therefore plan to meet him with one of my superiors at any time\r\n\r\nKIDDAWALIME KAMPALA Contacted Mr. Rukiika James and convinced him to buy. He bought 7tyres 700r16 1pc / 195r15 1pc / 185r14 2pc / 165r13 3pc\r\n\r\nLANDROVER Talked to Wasswa and he asked me to send him the picture for 265/75r16. I am therefore waiting for his feedback\r\n\r\nYOKUKU Talked to Mr. Akera the elect manager. He asked me to resend company details for discussion with his colleagues and see how they can do business with us'),
(7238, '2024-01-24 17:45:09', 16, 3, 0, 1, 'UGX 1.815.000'),
