(7240, '2024-01-25 17:31:26', 16, 1, 0, 1, 'ERAM UG LTD Talked to Peter. He told me to go and meet with one of the directors who is expected to schedule an appointment with fellow directors to talk about our services and products.\r\n\r\n'),
(7241, '2024-01-25 17:31:26', 16, 2, 0, 4, 'ZHANGZ Talked with Tito the procurement officer. He said that things are not okay with the company directors and share holders decided to divide companies due to internal circumstances. He therefore requested me to wait till they finish their meeting to which will be held on 29/1/20204\r\n\r\nFULCRUM I talked with Mugabe about meeting them with my superior. At first he was hesitating but finally convinced him and accepted to share with his superior about it. He promised to give me feedback in the evening\r\n\r\nKAFIIKA  ANIMAL FEEDS Contacted James but he did not pick. I sent him a message on WhatsApp but has not yet replied am still waiting for his response\r\n\r\nELLINGTON SAFARIS Contacted Shone but he did not pick. I will try to go back to his office and talk to him about 225/75r15'),
(7242, '2024-01-25 17:42:32', 50, 1, 0, 1, '1. scheduled a meeting with Bebeto coaches mr Okit with Mr Emma and Simon due tomorrow in the evening outside office\r\n2. KM investments managed to get the boss number am tyring to get a meeting to negotiate business they have fuel tank trailers am sure we can supply them with 315/70R22.5 and 11.00R22.5. will keep negotiating with them ad get them on board \r\n'),
(7243, '2024-01-26 17:31:47', 50, 1, 0, 1, '1. gerald of mothercare schools called to confirm for an order for next week so will call him on monday and proceed with order as he asked me to. He wants tyres sizes of 195R15 \r\n2. Mr Katumba is not in kampala but he promised to meet when his back to visit our station and proceed with more negotiations for the future\r\n3. AJ tours and travel are also promising as Mr Jack said on phone he even asked about the durability of our tyres to last since his vehicles travel alot. he wants tyres of 235/70R16 '),
(7244, '2024-01-26 17:42:34', 16, 1, 0, 2, 'IVAN TOUR RUBAGA Mr. Ivan liked 265/75r16 and 235/85r16 he promised to get back to me soon\r\n\r\nKREM EVENTS I did not see Mr. Apollo because he had gone out Kampala. But I also contacted Derrick and he promised to inform Mr. Apolo about my request'),
(7245, '2024-01-26 17:42:35', 16, 2, 0, 5, 'HEAVY INVESTMENT Bought 2pcs of 195r14c and they were delivered to Mubende\r\n\r\nVIVA Ssalongo told me to go tommorrow for the cheque\r\n\r\nAFRICAN QUEEN Tried to contact Mr. Ssenkubuge but he didnot pick I will arrange and go to Namanve to meet him\r\n\r\nTENTS 4 U Contacted Kayiza but he didnot pick\r\n\r\nARAB CONTRACTORS Contacted Muhammed but the number did not go through'),
