(7255, '2024-01-30 17:49:41', 16, 2, 0, 4, 'ZHANGZ Tito said that things are not yet resolved at their company but he promised to update me about business\r\n\r\nAFRICAN QUEEN Contacted Mr. Ssenkubuge but He said that in mid February they expect the BOD to pass the bid for expression of interest. So he requested to check in monitor\r\n\r\nPIN TRAVEL Mr. Kavulu said that he will call me for tyres\r\n\r\nKREM EVENTS Mr. Kaamuswaaga said that he wanted tyres and he used to call the number first number on my business card but no one picked. So he decided to buy somewhere else'),
(7256, '2024-01-30 17:49:41', 16, 6, 0, 1, 'Customers call and we do not pick'),
(7257, '2024-01-30 17:55:51', 50, 1, 0, 1, 'we visited Mr Fortunate of TBBL Metro and we had a good discussion promising business. He requested a quotation of some tyres and he still is inquisitive about our prices \r\nWe even made a WhatsApp group with him so we can handle his account and bring him on board real soon and start business '),
