(7283, '2024-02-05 17:30:52', 16, 2, 0, 5, 'KINKIZI TRADERS He has two cars that need tyres one will wear 750r16 HW 1pc and the other 195r15c 2tyres\r\n\r\nZERIPEN Manager Derrick told me to remind him in the first week of March this year\r\n\r\nTENTS 4 U Pius did not pick\r\n\r\nBLUE CRANE I called madam Hilda the procurement officer but she did not pick\r\n\r\nJCRC He said he will get back to me'),
