(7417, '2024-03-08 18:35:33', 16, 124, 0, 2, 'DAFRIC PROMISED 205R16 2pcs\r\n\r\nDEWIL INESTMENTS LTD 1000R20'),
(7418, '2024-03-11 17:46:09', 50, 1, 0, 4, 'NTAKE ABKERY they had no order since most of thr trucks are moving but they will alert me if they get any order this week .\r\nIVANOS LOGISTICS  they have no need but Mr Juluis siad he wanted to send an order whren the trucks are done inspecting. I hope tohear fromhim soon.\r\nTRAIN UP ACHILD SCHOOL met with Mr Katongole the fleetmaanger but he said i check him tomorrow the vehicles were all busy. \r\nMASABA ENTERPRISES went  to there premises in Natete and they seem to be well conserved and hard but will keep tryin gthem to see that they offer busienss. They have a number of fuso trucks for some small TBR tyres. like 265/70R19.5 etc '),
(7419, '2024-03-11 17:46:09', 50, 2, 0, 3, 'YY COACHES  teh manager Mr ogwang was not answering calls forour scheduled meeting so will push to his offcie tomorrow.\r\nKENROM CHEMICALS  emailed me asking for price of 21r5/70R16 but they will not send an lpo until they clear there debt thats due according to Mr Rogers .\r\nWONDERWELL SCHOOLS called them checking on the debt recovery but she said they went for a mid term break and will rerturn soon and clear the debt she promised. and requested for some more me. '),
(7420, '2024-03-11 17:50:10', 16, 1, 0, 2, 'CHINA RAILWAY SEVENTH GROUP. Met REN an Sulaiman. They were interested in 1200R20 and their tyre consumption seem to be high. Mr. REN promised to get back to me soon.\r\n\r\nBABY COACHES. Bought 2pcs of 315/80R22.5.'),
(7421, '2024-03-11 17:50:10', 16, 2, 0, 3, 'BAMBOO. I contacted the manager but he did not pick.\r\n\r\nJCRC. Mr. Ntege promised to get back to me.\r\n\r\nVITAFOAM. Joseph promise to give feedback from the mechanic.'),
(7422, '2024-03-11 17:50:10', 16, 3, 0, 1, '315/80R22.5.'),
(7423, '2024-03-11 17:50:10', 16, 4, 0, 1, '315/80R22.5.'),
