(7431, '2024-03-12 16:40:31', 16, 20, 0, 1, '185R14 5pcs'),
(7432, '2024-03-12 17:54:04', 50, 1, 0, 3, 'NTAKE ABAKERY  Mr Jotham took me for an inspection through some of the vehicles but they were still having good tyres and said i wait this week for some to come from mbale and masaka and he amy send in an order. He wanted tyres for his vehicle and we got him Tyres on credit of 30 days. \r\nMR OKIT BEBETO COACHES  he promised to send an order but his vehicles still have good Tyres i hope for him to come through in like 3 weeks time . \r\nIVANOS LOGISTICS Mr Julius was promising for an order and got him some commission from old orders. I got that so it will be soon. '),
(7433, '2024-03-12 17:54:04', 50, 2, 0, 1, 'AMBIANCE DISTILLERS called her and she had concerns about the delay in commission but explained to her the policy and she will wait till the debts settle from the old [ending cheques '),
(7434, '2024-03-12 17:54:04', 50, 3, 0, 1, '205/70R14 for Mr Jotham 4 tyres. '),
(7435, '2024-03-14 17:08:12', 16, 1, 0, 4, 'CHINA WU YI CO. Met HR Cate and told me that the procurement manager is still abroad.\r\n\r\nCEVA. Moses requested for 750R16 price quote.\r\n\r\nVIVA. They ordered for 315/80R22.5 10pcs'),
(7436, '2024-03-14 17:08:12', 16, 3, 0, 2, '315/80R22.5 12pcs'),
(7437, '2024-03-14 17:08:12', 16, 4, 0, 2, '315/80R22.5 12pcs'),
(7438, '2024-03-14 17:08:12', 16, 10, 0, 12, '315/80R22.5'),
(7439, '2024-03-14 17:43:16', 50, 1, 0, 1, 'NTAKE BAKERY delivering the tyres they ordered for 155R12c and 265/70R19.5 total of 4 pieces. I tried talking them t replace the 7.00R16 tyres of mud grip with all position that we have in stock. Will a get response from him tomorrow hopefully. \r\n'),
(7440, '2024-03-14 17:43:16', 50, 2, 0, 2, 'KASABA COACHES called the manager and he was willing to meet me so we can talk and i try getting business from him. They have a fleet of buses and they are a good account to bring on board for 315/80R22.5\r\nBISMARKAN COACHES  they have a few dynamics on who to meet but will visit the offices and have a one on one with them so we can get them on board. '),
(7441, '2024-03-14 17:43:16', 50, 5, 0, 3, 'YY BUSES \r\nKASABA COACH \r\nBISMARKAN COACHES '),
(7442, '2024-03-15 17:23:42', 50, 1, 0, 3, 'KASABA COACHES they are willing to meet and talk on how we can offer business and supply them. Made an appointment with the manager and his promising will keep in touch and follow up next week so we meet and see a way forward on business terms.\r\nBISMARKAN COACHES they are bus company with a few buses less than 10 but will get to them for busienss in a formal approach on Monday and make iut happen with them seeing this through. They will ideally be suitable company to supply our TBR tyres of 315/80R22.5\r\nKM INVESTMENTS they are getting dormant and seem not to be responding positively to our proposal of business with  them especially the boss himself. For thus i decided to let them aside for a while.  '),
(7443, '2024-03-15 17:23:42', 50, 2, 0, 2, 'TRAIN UP A CHILD  made a call to Mr Katongole and informed me that they  have not procured him money to buy tyres any soon but his promising and will keep following up on him in the short while . \r\nNTAKE BAKERY  to check if they have supplied Mr Jotham the tyres we had failed to supply to him but he was quite rude and unpleased by this action and he agreed to check on the stores and see if they have supplied yet '),
(7444, '2024-03-15 17:53:51', 16, 1, 0, 1, 'BABY COACHES. Ordered for 10pcs of 315/80R22.5'),
(7445, '2024-03-15 17:53:51', 16, 3, 0, 1, '315/80R22.5'),
(7446, '2024-03-15 17:53:51', 16, 4, 0, 1, '315/80R22.5'),
(7447, '2024-03-15 17:53:51', 16, 6, 0, 1, 'Baby coach manager says that the price is too high for 315/80R22.5'),
(7448, '2024-03-15 17:53:51', 16, 10, 0, 10, '315/80R22.5'),
(7449, '2024-03-15 17:53:51', 16, 14, 0, 1, 'BABY COACHES'),
(7450, '2024-03-16 17:28:17', 50, 3, 0, 1, 'Ntake bakery bought 4 tyres of 7.50R16 and 4 tyres of 8.25R16 '),
(7451, '2024-03-18 17:49:22', 16, 1, 0, 1, 'TUJE SAFARIS. I did not see the manager but I will go back some other time.'),
(7452, '2024-03-18 17:49:22', 16, 2, 0, 2, 'TRONIC. Khalid promised to come for 205R16 in the first week of April.\r\n\r\nBABY COACH. Kasaija promised to call me for more business of 315/80R22.5.'),
(7453, '2024-03-18 17:57:15', 50, 1, 0, 3, 'GADITH INVESTMENTS  the manager of Ivanos gave me a lead to the purchasing officer of the company called Gusta and he requested we meet another day out of office \r\nYY COACHES the general manager is still hard to get onto business terms but the transport officer said he can offer us business. will have to keep convincing the manager for a while.\r\nAMBIANCE DISTILLERS went to check on Stella and she gave me an order of 195R15C whic we supplied today  '),
(7454, '2024-03-18 17:57:15', 50, 3, 0, 1, '195R15c 4 tyres to ambiance distillers '),
(7455, '2024-03-18 17:57:15', 50, 4, 0, 1, '195r15c 4 tyres to ambiance distillers '),
(7456, '2024-03-19 17:33:29', 50, 1, 0, 3, 'GADITH INVESTMENTS met Mr Gasta and we talked he was inquisitive why they have no handler to get business for them and yet they where good players. They promised to join soon and resume business. \r\nKASABA OACHES the manager was okay giving us business though he was still worried on pricing and payment plan. I promised him to have a negotiation soon and make sure he gets a fair price for his tyres. \r\nTRAIN UP A CHILD they are really promising though the transport manager katongole still has not yet got money from the procurement. '),
(7457, '2024-03-19 17:33:29', 50, 2, 0, 1, 'KENROM CHEMICALS  to check on the inquiry they emailed me of 215/70r16. They will respond soon when they are ready according to the procurement officer '),
(7458, '2024-03-19 17:42:17', 16, 1, 0, 1, 'TRINITY Ordered for 11r22.5 6pcs but we only supplied 4pcs because of limited stock ie 3pcs were rodeo and 1pc was boto'),
(7459, '2024-03-19 17:42:17', 16, 2, 0, 3, 'VIVA Deposited a cheque of 4million\r\n\r\nKIDDAWALIME Contacted Mr. Rukiika to ask him business for tyres but his number was off\r\n\r\nCXPRESS Patrick promised to come anytime for tyres and alignment'),
(7460, '2024-03-20 17:44:46', 16, 1, 0, 2, 'BABY COACH Paid 1.800.000\r\n\r\nSALT HOLIDAYS They said they like 235/85r16'),
(7461, '2024-03-20 17:44:46', 16, 2, 0, 3, 'ELLY SERVICE STATION Kafiifi said that he wants 19.5LR24\r\n\r\nKINKIZI Manager Frank did not pick\r\n\r\nJCRC Willy said that the boss finished to approve the prequalification. He said that they are going to start calling the prequalified applicants for the signed letters. He therefore asked me to wait for the call from JCRC\r\n\r\n'),
(7462, '2024-03-20 18:15:07', 50, 1, 0, 1, 'KASABA COACHES had a meeting at their garage with the office of procurement and he was willing to offer business s will keep in touch \r\nhe agreed to our prices and we will get him into business soon am sure \r\n'),
(7463, '2024-03-20 18:15:07', 50, 3, 0, 1, 'ambiance distillers bought one piece of 225/75r16 '),
(7464, '2024-03-21 17:13:30', 50, 1, 0, 3, 'PEARL ENGINEERING met them but they have no ongoing contract so the cant guarantee business but the procurement officer is willing to give in a a bid notice so we can submit forthe next contract they present.\r\nAMBIANCE DISTILLERS wanted to check on delivery and debt recovery they promised the debts will be cleared. They gave me an order of 265/70R19.5 but the tyres were of mudgrip and failed to be delivered. \r\nKASABA COACHES they are willing to give us business they are promising and will keep attending to them an get them on board. they have a fleet of 12 buses in total. '),
(7465, '2024-03-21 17:13:30', 50, 4, 0, 2, 'KENROMCHEMICALS  wanted a quotation for 215/70R16 4 tyres \r\nAMBIANCE DISTILLERS  wanted 265/70R19.5 but some of them are not in stock ie the mud grip Tyres. '),
(7466, '2024-03-21 17:56:57', 16, 2, 0, 6, 'KAZI FOOD LOGISTICS The director referred me to the logistics manager and he asked me to go to Kyambogo office\r\n\r\nDAFRIC Bought 2pcs of 205r16\r\n\r\nJAGUA Geofrey promised to call me when boss Jane comes to the garage for business discussion\r\n\r\nZERIPEN Derrick did not pick But I will try to go there some other time\r\n\r\nVITAFOAM They want 8.25r20 4pcs today or tomorrow\r\n\r\nELLY SERVICE STATION They need 1000r20 20pcs'),
(7467, '2024-03-21 17:56:57', 16, 6, 0, 1, 'Limited stock hinders performance eg 1000r20 and 8.25r20'),
(7468, '2024-03-22 16:59:32', 16, 1, 0, 1, 'VITA FOAM. Orderd for 4pcs of 852R20.'),
(7469, '2024-03-22 16:59:32', 16, 2, 0, 5, 'KIDDAWALIME. Mr. Rukika asked me to chech on him on tuesday next week before march ends for business.\r\n\r\nHAJATI SUMAYA. She needs 225/65R17. But she promised to call when ready to take tyres.\r\n\r\nTRAIN A CHILD SEETA. Tried to contact the vans manager but his number was off.\r\n\r\nHEAVY INVESTMENT. Order for 205/65R15.\r\n\r\nSUPA LOAF. The manager said that they still have a runing contract with city tyres.'),
(7470, '2024-03-22 16:59:32', 16, 3, 0, 2, '8825R20\r\n\r\n205/65R15'),
(7471, '2024-03-22 16:59:32', 16, 4, 0, 2, '8825R20\r\n\r\n205/65R15'),
(7472, '2024-03-22 16:59:32', 16, 10, 0, 5, '8825R20\r\n\r\n205/65R15'),
(7473, '2024-03-22 18:04:54', 50, 1, 0, 2, 'AMBIANCE DISTILLERS they sent in a lorry to fit tyres for 265/70r19.5 and this was done on station. they promised to send in a vehicle tomorrow. \r\nBEBETO COACHES the management from their company came and this was a successful meeting. They requested a proforma for 315/80R22.5 on a discounted price of 880'),
(7474, '2024-03-22 18:04:54', 50, 2, 0, 1, 'KENROM CHEMICALS they sent mails asking about prices on the proforma we sent yesterday but Mr. Rogers promised to send a LOP tomorrow for the tyres. '),
(7475, '2024-03-22 18:04:54', 50, 3, 0, 1, 'AMBIANCE  DISTILLERS  they bought 6 tyres of 265/70r19.5 '),
(7476, '2024-03-22 18:04:54', 50, 4, 0, 1, 'BEBETO COACH they requested for a proforma of 315/80R22.5 expected to be bought on monday '),
(7477, '2024-03-23 17:01:13', 50, 2, 0, 2, 'NTAKE BAKERY they have no need as of now but will keep track with Jotham. \r\nKENROM CHEMICALS called Rogers and he said his not in office will try them monday morning to follow up on the quoted order'),
(7478, '2024-03-23 17:01:14', 50, 4, 0, 1, 'ETS RIZKA quotation for 315/80R22.5 6 tyres mud grip and 4 tyres of highway. He requested we deliver monday morning the mud grip tyres '),
(7479, '2024-03-25 18:17:45', 16, 1, 0, 1, 'TRINITY. Met madam Jacky. she told me to leave a statement and she told me to wait for feedback from Mark the workshop manager.'),
(7480, '2024-03-25 18:17:45', 16, 2, 0, 5, 'MBUNI AFRICAN SAFARIS. Ibrah promised to give me feedback on friday.\r\n\r\nBWEBALE . Jimmy promised to come for 215/75R17.5 soon.\r\n\r\nDAFRIC. Tom wanted 195R15. but he said that it is too expensive\r\n\r\nCHINA GEO . Sent manager Ling a message but he has not replied yet. but I will keep on pushing .\r\n\r\nBABY COACH. They promised to pay today'),
(7481, '2024-03-25 18:35:52', 50, 1, 0, 4, 'ETS RIZKA bought 6 tyres of mud grip 315/80R22.5 he promised more business if we can make a better price for him. \r\nKENROM CHEMICALS made an LPO for the tyres they ordered of 215/70r16 and will be prepared for delivery \r\nBEBETO COACHES they did not respond to the delivery as quoted on the  tyrs they wanted. \r\nNTAKE BAKERY  sent an order of some tyres like 6.50r14 185r14 among others '),
(7482, '2024-03-25 18:35:52', 50, 2, 0, 1, 'BISMARKAN COACHES mr emma did not make a sure response on when we will supply them. but promised ana order this week '),
(7483, '2024-03-25 18:35:52', 50, 3, 0, 1, 'ETS RIZKA 316/80R22.5 6  tyres '),
(7484, '2024-03-25 18:35:52', 50, 4, 0, 1, 'NTAKE BAKERY  they ordered for a number of Tyres like \r\n6.50r14'),
(7485, '2024-03-26 17:14:10', 50, 1, 0, 3, 'NTAKE BAKERY delivery was made this morning for the order they sent yesterday for 24 tyres. They promised to send another one next week because of the need they have lately. \r\nBEBETO COACHES they called for delivery of the tyres they ordered for 315/80r22.5 and this was delivered in 12 tyres. they however to pay daily amounts so they clear the debt soon. \r\nKENROM CHEMICALS they also there tyres they ordered of 215/70R16 they ordered too. Mr rogers the procurement officer made an update of payment and they also admitted they paid today for the old invoice. \r\n'),
(7486, '2024-03-26 17:14:10', 50, 2, 0, 2, 'BISMARKAN COACHES called Emma and he said he has no need for now but he promised to make an order with us soon. I expect one from him soon next week. \r\nAMBIANCE DISTILLERS madam stella said she has some vehicles coming from masaka she will wait and see if they need any tyres '),
(7487, '2024-03-26 17:14:10', 50, 3, 0, 3, 'NTAKE BAKERY took tyres of quantity 24 and this was mainly light truck tyres like 9.25r18 among others \r\nBEBETO COACHES they also bought 12 tyres of 315/80r22.5 \r\nKENROM CHEMICALS also bought 4 tyres of 215/70R16 '),
(7488, '2024-03-26 18:28:12', 16, 1, 0, 4, 'KAZI FOOD LOGISTICS met Mr. Raja. He asked me to share a company profile'),
(7489, '2024-03-26 18:28:12', 16, 2, 0, 1, 'TRINITY Boaz said that they are going to pay for only new orders'),
(7508, '2024-03-27 17:05:47', 16, 1, 0, 1, 'BABY COACH. Paid 1'),
(7509, '2024-03-27 17:05:47', 16, 2, 0, 1, 'ELLY SERVICE STATION. Matovu asked me to update him on the 1000R20 oder.'),
(7510, '2024-03-27 17:05:47', 16, 3, 0, 2, 'RODEO 315/80R22.5 HW\r\n\r\nTRINITY. Boaz promised to pay very soon'),
(7511, '2024-03-27 17:05:47', 16, 4, 0, 1, 'RODEO 315/80R22.5 HW'),
(7512, '2024-03-27 17:05:47', 16, 8, 0, 1, '1'),
(7513, '2024-03-27 17:05:47', 16, 10, 0, 20, 'RODEO 315/80R22.5 HW'),
(7514, '2024-03-27 18:13:03', 50, 1, 0, 3, 'NILE STAR COACH  met with the manager and he was willing to talk and offer business but will need to meet his mechanical team so that i talk to them too on our tyres. Thye have a number of buses that have 315/80r22.5 and 11.00R22.5 \r\nTRAIN UP A CHILD katongole is still promising but will keep in touch with him so i can make sure he buys they still have not yet acquired money from the procurement team. \r\nGADITH INVESTMENTS met with Mr Gusta and he asked for prices with VAT and promised to keep engaged on the next supply i hope he gives us the  order '),
(7515, '2024-03-27 18:13:03', 50, 2, 0, 2, 'AMBIANCE DISTILLERS stella called on the cheques they gave us that we wait banking it and followed  up on recovery. \r\nKENROM CHEMICALS paid the early invoice they had pending and promised to pay the next one in time too. '),
(7516, '2024-03-28 17:30:39', 50, 1, 0, 2, 'NILE STAR COACH met the transport manager and had time to convince him with our brand of tyres but he seemed quite impressed and it is a promising account if we get business from them. \r\nNABUGABO UP DEAL VENTURES the purchasing officer Mr Emma shared the contatcts and mails of the transport officer and told me to negotiate with him because he is InCharge of all supplys to Tyres for the fleet and i scheduled an appointment with him on Monday morning '),
(7517, '2024-03-28 17:30:39', 50, 2, 0, 3, 'TRAIN UP ACHILD  katongole is not yet given money to buy the tyres for his vehicles but his still promising. \r\nEMMA of BISMARKAN COACHES also wants to buy but tyres are still okay on his vehicles but also promising. \r\nBEBETO COACHES Mr Okit called telling me to get some money from their office but he did not call me back or answer my calls '),
(7518, '2024-03-29 17:00:35', 50, 1, 0, 1, 'BEBETO COACHES Mr okit called me to see the tyres complaint he had. They have afear the tyres might not with stand the eight and roads they use to travel. I had to recommend a different size that is 13r22.5 which will be here by next week. '),
(7519, '2024-03-29 17:00:35', 50, 2, 0, 1, 'AMBIANCE DISTILLERS they seem to not have any need for now so Stella promised to wait after the easter period they may have need. She was not happy with the commission rates after i had to get her commission yesterday. '),
(7520, '2024-03-29 17:20:49', 16, 1, 0, 1, 'BABY COACH. Paid 1'),
(7521, '2024-04-02 18:09:17', 16, 2, 0, 10, 'ELLY SERVICE STATION Matovu said that he still waiting for 100R20\r\nKIDDAWALIME Mr Rukika said that he will come in two days\r\nVITAFOAM HR Joseph promised that they are going to prepare the payment cheque tomorrow Wednesday\r\nFULCRUM tried to contact Phillip but he did not pick\r\nDR KIRUNDA Promised to come today\r\nKALIRO SUGAR FISAL promised to get back to me very soon\r\nPIN TRAVEL Mr Ravulu promised to get back to me about 235/85R16 and bought 195R15 2pcs\r\nALEX KOLOLO Mr ALex said that the season not good currently for them but he promised to get back to me\r\nVITAFOAM Balaji requested for a price quote of 825R20 tube\r\nDAFRIC ordered for 205R16 1pc'),
(7522, '2024-04-03 16:07:28', 16, 1, 0, 2, 'YO KUKU. Idid not see manager Akera because he had gone for a leave. but when I contacted him'),
(7523, '2024-04-03 16:07:28', 16, 2, 0, 4, 'TRONIC. Bought 4pcs of 205R16.\r\n\r\nKREM EVENTS. Contacted Apolo but he did no pick.\r\n\r\nTRINITY. Boaz promised to get back to me soon.\r\n\r\nADMAN SOURCE. Patrick referred me to his superior and gave me directions to his office.\r\n'),
(7524, '2024-04-03 16:07:28', 16, 3, 0, 1, '205R16'),
(7525, '2024-04-03 16:07:28', 16, 4, 0, 1, '205R16'),
(7526, '2024-04-03 16:07:28', 16, 10, 0, 4, '205R16'),
(7527, '2024-04-03 17:25:12', 50, 1, 0, 2, '1. BEBETO COACHES to get some monetary collections and they have an issue they have with the tyre but was sorted technically. The boss was not contented but this was a mess sorted. \r\n2.TRAIN UP A CHILD  the procurement team has not yet let Mr Katongole buy tyres for the fleet yet but will keep engaged with him o see results in the near future. '),
(7528, '2024-04-03 17:25:12', 50, 3, 0, 1, 'NTAKE BAKERY bought 6 tyres of mudgrip 315/80R22.5 '),
(7529, '2024-04-04 16:22:03', 16, 2, 0, 7, 'EVENTS LIMITED. Phillip promised to get back to me after meeting.\r\n\r\nPIN TRAVEL. Kavulu wants 235/85R16 JOYROAD at 450000.\r\n\r\nBABY COACH. Kasaija promised to pay some money today evening.\r\n\r\nELLINGTON SAFARIS. Cotacted Shon but he did not pick.\r\n\r\nVITAFOAM. Balaji promised to clear next week.\r\n\r\nNAMUYOMBA INVESTMENTS. Bashir promised to come for 11R but he is still in Amuru district.\r\n\r\nADVENTURE SAFARIS. Manager said that the season is low so they do not have any business at the moment.'),
(7530, '2024-04-04 17:22:21', 50, 2, 0, 3, 'KM INVESTMENTS called Mr Ibra to see how far with the new project he promised to attach us to supply them tyres but he did not answer calls but will visit him next week. \r\nMOTHERCARE SCHOOLS  Mr. Gerald is promising to buy soon but seems they have issue with embarking money from the procurement team thus delays. He promised orders soon. \r\nKIWI ENTERPRISES they are a company distributing commodities around Kampala and have many vehicles and i got a contact to the person in charge of buying Mr Semakula and he asked me to meet him at office '),
(7531, '2024-04-04 17:22:21', 50, 3, 0, 1, 'AMBIANCE DISTILLERS sent in truck for fitting tyres 265/70R16 4 tyres. '),
(7532, '2024-04-05 15:43:26', 16, 1, 0, 3, 'TAHFEEZ TOURS. I met the manager and he liked 195R15. He asked the transport officer to come to our office for more analysis.\r\n\r\nMEDECINES. Met David the manager and he said that they use 750R16. He said that they are soon starting to do tyre supplier inspection'),
(7533, '2024-04-05 15:43:27', 16, 2, 0, 5, 'ZINDA. Swaibu  said that he has no business at the moment.\r\n\r\nCHINA GEO. Tang requested for the price quote of 1200R20.\r\n\r\nVIVA. Ssalongo asked me to check on him next week.\r\n\r\nKIIW HARDWARE. The boss asked me to check on next week after sorting his police issues.\r\n\r\nKIDDAWALIME. Mr. Rukika promised to come on monday next week.'),
(7534, '2024-04-05 15:43:27', 16, 14, 0, 4, 'VIVA \r\nKIDDAWALIME\r\nZINDA\r\nCHINA GEO'),
(7535, '2024-04-05 17:12:15', 50, 2, 0, 5, 'ETS RIZKA made some calls to remind Mr Fortunate on the order he had promised early this month and he asked for a quotation hope he buys soon. the tyres of mud grip and highway for 315/80R22.5 \r\nWONDERWELL SCHOOL Madam Rehma is not answering calls or texts this unresposive will push me to go meet her on monday to recover the debt.\r\nIVANOS LOGISTICS Mr Julius still had no need for tyres for his trucks but will let me know when he has need soon. \r\nBEBETO COACHES Mr Okit did not tell me if they had any money for the debt but he also asked about the replacement and i told him that will not be possible. \r\nZAWADI BUSES called there office line and the lady got me the contact to the fleet manager will engage him and meet to talk about the tyres and see if they can let us offer business. '),
(7536, '2024-04-05 17:12:16', 50, 3, 0, 1, 'NTAKE BAKERY they ordered for 6 tyres of 195r15c which were delivered on time. '),
(7537, '2024-04-06 16:56:03', 50, 2, 0, 1, 'ETS RIZKA called Mr Fortunate but no response on the quotation he has issue with the price so will engage him on Monday further more as he promised '),
(7538, '2024-04-06 17:28:22', 16, 1, 0, 1, 'BABY COACH. Paid 10'),
(7539, '2024-04-06 17:28:22', 16, 3, 0, 1, 'DAFRIC LOGISTICS 195R15C'),
(7540, '2024-04-06 17:28:22', 16, 4, 0, 1, '195R15C'),
(7541, '2024-04-06 17:28:22', 16, 10, 0, 2, '195R15C'),
(7542, '2024-04-06 17:28:22', 16, 14, 0, 1, 'DAFRIC LOGISTICS'),
(7543, '2024-04-08 18:01:35', 16, 1, 0, 2, 'TRINITY EXPRESS Boaz asked me to go back on Wednesday for the cheque\r\n\r\nKREM EVENT MANAGEMENT Bought 4pcs of 195r14c'),
(7544, '2024-04-08 18:01:35', 16, 2, 0, 6, 'TIMO asked me to go and meet him tomorrow\r\n\r\nTAHFEEZ Manager Musa promised to come tomorrow\r\n\r\nBABY COACH Saalim promised to pay on Friday\r\n\r\nPIN TRAVEL Contacted manager but he did not pick\r\n\r\nKIDDAWALIME Bought 1pc of 700r16\r\n\r\nDAFRIC Logistics bought 2pcs of 205r16\r\n'),
(7545, '2024-04-08 18:01:36', 16, 3, 0, 3, '4 pcs of 195r14 to krem investments \r\n\r\n2pcs of 205r16 to Dafric logistics\r\n\r\n1pc of 700r16 to Kiddawalime'),
(7546, '2024-04-08 18:01:36', 16, 8, 0, 1, '385.000 from Dafric logistics'),
(7547, '2024-04-08 18:01:36', 16, 10, 0, 7, '7pcs ');
INSERT INTO `checklist_response` (`checklist_response_id`, `date`, `user_id`, `checklist_id`, `client_id`, `value`, `narration`) VALUES
(7548, '2024-04-09 16:50:35', 50, 1, 0, 2, 'AMBIANCE DISTILLERS for debt recovery but they were not positive as of today so will engage them again soon so we can get some cash  from their previous debts \r\nBEBETO COACH they still have a complaint on quality and size but i told them we can not replace the tyres since they are used now but will make sure we get the outstanding balance from them already. \r\nPRAISE DISTRIBUTORS they are okay wit  the pricing but they will contact me incase of anything according to the InCharge i met today. '),
(7549, '2024-04-09 16:50:35', 50, 2, 0, 2, 'ETS RIZKA  Mr Fortunat gave off the order to another supplier due to high pricing on the mud grip tyre of 315/80R22.5 but he promised to order soon after i told him we can negotiate the prices duly \r\nWONDERWELL INT SCHOOL the headteacher still said we wait for the balance on Friday they had some delays in payment to suppliers and service providers. She promised to send the balance on friday '),
(7550, '2024-04-09 17:16:19', 16, 1, 0, 2, 'KREM EVENTS Paid and cleared their balance and Mr. Kamuswaaga said he is going to give me more business\r\n\r\nFULCRUM Met Phillip and Mugabe. They came to office for store inspection They liked 315/80r22.5 and requested for a quotation of 4pcs HW'),
(7551, '2024-04-09 17:16:19', 16, 2, 0, 4, 'VIVA Ssalongo said we shall get in touch before this week ends\r\n\r\nMEDICINES SANS Talked with David. He said he will talk to his boss about our tyres and wheel alignment package. He also confirmed to come for inspection. He asked me to check on him next week on Friday for updates.\r\n\r\nIVAN TOURS Contacted Mr. Ivan but he did not pick\r\n\r\nCHINA RAILWAY Tried to contacted Sulaiman but he said that he was driving and promised to call back'),
(7552, '2024-04-11 17:41:14', 50, 1, 0, 2, 'AMBAINCE DISTILLERS checked on their need for any supply but not any as yet but they said we bank the cheque of 27th and go get some cash tomorrow and cheques too. \r\nIVANOS LOGISTICS they do not have any need yet but they will send in an order soon as possible. the trucks have been mostly parked lately. \r\n'),
(7553, '2024-04-11 17:41:14', 50, 2, 0, 1, 'NILE STAR BUS  called the manager trying to meet him but he was not in office and said we shall meet next week probably he will be in office and will have time. \r\n'),
(7554, '2024-04-11 17:41:14', 50, 6, 0, 1, 'BEBETO COACHES they still complain about the tyre size and they want  a replacement which can not be made for old tyres. they used al the tyres we sold to them. But the recovery of the debt will continue. '),
(7555, '2024-04-11 18:00:31', 16, 1, 0, 2, 'VIVA Paid 20M with 4 cheques\r\n\r\nTRINITY Talked to Boaz about payment. He requested for some time to follow the cheque movement'),
(7556, '2024-04-11 18:00:31', 16, 2, 0, 4, 'YO KUKU Walter asked me to check on him on Monday next week\r\n\r\nPIN TRAVEL Mr. Kavulu promised to bring the vehicle after repair for 235/80r16\r\n\r\nARAB CONTRACTORS Muhammad promised to come for 1200r24\r\n\r\nCHINA RAILWAY Gu requested for a price quote of 1400r24 for 30pcs'),
(7557, '2024-04-12 15:44:19', 50, 1, 0, 1, 'AMBIANCE DISTILLERS they wanted tyres of 195r15c and also checked on payments according to the statement \r\nKIWI ENTERPRISES the manager wanted to understand on how we supply and the brands so he will come and visit the shops to see the brands. '),
(7558, '2024-04-12 15:44:19', 50, 3, 0, 1, 'AMBIANCE SDISTILLERS took tyres of 195r15c and 265/60R18 total of 6 tyres'),
(7559, '2024-04-12 15:52:51', 16, 1, 0, 1, 'TRINITY Paid 2.640.000 and remained with a balance of 880.000'),
(7560, '2024-04-12 15:52:51', 16, 2, 0, 7, 'VIVA Deposited a cheque of 5million\r\n\r\nBABY COACH Promised to pay today evening\r\n\r\nDAFRIC Tried to contact Tom but he did not pick\r\n\r\nZERIPEN Tried to contact Derrick but he did not pick\r\n\r\nCHINA RAILWAY Gu asked me to check on him on 22/4/2024 Monday for orders\r\n\r\nNAMUKUPA HARDWARE Badru went to Kyaggwe. He told me that he will come back on Monday\r\n\r\nPIN TRAVEL Paid off the balance'),
(7561, '2024-04-13 13:44:30', 19, 156, 0, 0, ''),
(7562, '2024-04-13 13:44:30', 19, 158, 0, 0, ''),
(7563, '2024-04-13 13:44:30', 19, 162, 0, 1, 'lkkoih'),
