(7578, '2024-04-13 13:44:30', 19, 160, 0, 0, ''),
(7579, '2024-04-13 15:03:46', 50, 2, 0, 2, 'NABUGABO UPDEAL Mr Ivan said we shall schedule a meeting sonn when his free. \r\nZAWADI COACH they want some tyres soon so will be communicating with us soon. '),
(7580, '2024-04-13 15:03:46', 50, 3, 0, 1, 'BEBETO CACHES bought 2 tyres of 13r22.5 tyres and will pay the old debt on monday. '),
(7581, '2024-04-15 17:06:27', 50, 2, 0, 2, 'KATONGOLE TRAIN UP A CHILD he promised to buy soon but his response seems not sure will consider him dormant for now since his returns seem un reliable. \r\nNILE STAR COACH they lost a bus in an accident recently so the manager said he will call me when he comes back to Kampala. He suggests we wait till then and meet to discuss about prices and brands we have. '),
(7582, '2024-04-15 17:06:27', 50, 5, 0, 2, 'NABUGABO UP DEAL JOINT VENTURES they have promised to buy from us soon after a literal discussion with the manager . they have a number of trucks and light trucks \r\nZAWADI BUSES after talking to the manager with help from Rose they promised to start buying soon '),
(7583, '2024-04-15 17:06:27', 50, 6, 0, 1, 'AMBIANCE DISTILLERS made a complaint about the tyres they bought of 265/60R18 but will handle that with their transport manager. '),
(7584, '2024-04-15 17:12:25', 16, 1, 0, 3, 'BABY COACH Paid 3.600.000\r\n\r\nTRINITY Did not see Marck because he had gone for the meeting with all other managers. I will go there tomorrow and meet him\r\n\r\nNAMUKUPA Badiru promised to call me when there is need for tyres'),
(7585, '2024-04-15 17:12:25', 16, 2, 0, 4, 'TUJE SAFARIS Contacted Kirunda but he did not pick\r\n\r\nUGANDA TODAY TOURS Contacted Micheal but he did not pick\r\n\r\nCHINA RAILWAY Contacted Sulaiman he told me to hold on for a week to wait for Mr. Gu to come back from the field\r\n\r\nVITAFOAM Contacted Eva about payment but she said that she hasnot received any cheque from Jinja\r\n\r\n'),
(7586, '2024-04-16 10:27:52', 23, 155, 0, 0, ''),
(7587, '2024-04-16 10:27:52', 23, 156, 0, 0, ''),
(7588, '2024-04-16 10:27:52', 23, 162, 0, 0, ''),
