(7602, '2024-04-16 10:27:52', 23, 144, 0, 0, ''),
(7603, '2024-04-16 10:27:52', 23, 160, 0, 0, ''),
(7604, '2024-04-16 16:52:46', 50, 1, 0, 3, 'DENOVO BAKERY met with manager ssemakula in natete at their garage but he was not promising since he said the fleet still has some stunt vehicles but he will be in touch incase of new business soon will be following up closely. \r\nMASABA HARDWARE they have a supplier as per now but they are willing to switch if we can offer them tyres they buy at a fair price. They have a number of trucks like fuso and light trucks. \r\nBEBETO COACH i went to check on the balance payment and order for 13R22.5 as they had promised soon but they did not happen to have it in plan so will check in tomorrow. '),
(7605, '2024-04-16 16:52:46', 50, 2, 0, 2, 'ROYAL FOAM called there office line t schedule a meeting with the transport manager but did not happen to get a response. \r\nBISMARKAN COACH called in to check for any need for now but they did not have any soon till next week according to Mr Muhawe. '),
(7606, '2024-04-16 17:51:01', 16, 1, 0, 2, 'NOOR LOGISTICS Talked to Mr. Muhammad. He promised business If our prices are lower that city tyres because its the current supplier.\r\n\r\nAGRO WAYS Met Moses the procurement manager. He said that he will come to office for inspection and he promised business after a few months because they have just restocked.'),
(7607, '2024-04-16 17:51:02', 16, 2, 0, 1, 'VITAFOAM Bought 4pcs of 9.5r17.5 MD'),
(7608, '2024-04-17 16:17:49', 50, 1, 0, 4, 'KIJAMBU HARDWARE they have issues with there fleet but will stay in touch with the manager Alex for any need that arises. \r\nKIRI BOTTLING the manager was not in office when we arrived but got his contact and will try scheduling a meeting with soon. \r\nZAWADI BUS the manager said he still had  a doubt on trying a new client so we will keep engaging til  when he admits using our tyres.\r\nPREMIER DISTILLERS they have a lot of light trucks but the InCharge Mr Yagnesh said he works with another supplier and is not willing to change. '),
(7609, '2024-04-17 16:17:49', 50, 2, 0, 2, 'NTAKE BAKERY  Mr Jotham said he has no need yet but will call soon incase he gets any need. \r\nIVANOS LOGISTICS Julius said he is still onto buying a new trailer bed and will buy when the trailer starts working. '),
(7610, '2024-04-17 16:26:24', 16, 1, 0, 5, 'WIN WORLD IMPEX Met Milan the procurement manager. He said that they use 315/80r22.5 and 155r12. He promised business soon\r\n\r\nKIIWA HARDWARE Met Kiiwa Junior the son. He said that currently they have some issues. But he asked me the price list just incase they find a room to buy tyres.\r\n\r\nAFRO KAI LTD Met Mr. Edward the transport manager. He asked for the company profile and he promised business soon. So i need to constantly check on him\r\n\r\nNEIM ESTABLISHMENT Met one of the workers. He gave me the number for Mr. Katumba who will give me the details of the company\r\n\r\nTRINITY Boazi promised to clear the balance when afande signs the paymeny slip'),
(7611, '2024-04-17 16:26:24', 16, 2, 0, 1, 'ELLY SERVICE STATION Matovu requested for a price quote of 245/70r16'),
(7612, '2024-04-18 15:16:51', 16, 1, 0, 5, 'AISH TUMUSIIME. Met Shafik the manager. He said they mostly use 315/80R22.5 and he promised to give us more business.\r\n\r\nPANAFRIC LOGISTICS. Met manager Hamidi. He said that they mostly use 1200R24 and 315/80R22.5. He promised business soon and requested for 60days with a PDC.\r\n\r\nUCTU. I did not see any person at there office but the neighbors say that they are not active in business currently.\r\n\r\nMAGANJO GRAIN MILLERS. I stopped at the gate because the manager had gone to Jinja for a meeting. But the person i met there gave his number. I will try to call him for an appointment.\r\n\r\nROKO. I met Mr. Odongo and referred me to Bakka because he is the one who does the requisition for tyres.\r\n\r\n'),
(7613, '2024-04-18 16:57:05', 50, 1, 0, 3, 'KAWEMPE-MATUGGA \r\n1. PYRAMID HARDWARE is a hardware at kawempe and have a number of trailers'),
(7614, '2024-04-18 16:57:05', 50, 8, 0, 1, 'NTAKE BAKERY paid a sum of  39'),
(7615, '2024-04-19 17:13:26', 16, 1, 0, 2, 'BABY COACHES Saalim promised to pay tomorrow\r\n\r\nTRINITY Mark said that he submitted the tyre requisition. He therefore promised to call me approved'),
(7616, '2024-04-19 17:13:26', 16, 2, 0, 4, 'NEIM ESTABLISHMENT Contacted Katumba He promised to call me and give me the number for the person in charge of buying tyres\r\n\r\nROKO Mr. Bakka said that he is willing to support us. He therefore promised to call for business\r\n\r\nCEVA Talked to Mr. Moses and he said that he will check whether we are approved to supply them when he comes back to office\r\n\r\nDAFRIC Promised to pay next week Friday'),
(7617, '2024-04-22 16:24:40', 50, 1, 0, 2, 'NASUR INVESTMENTS the boss Mr Nasir was in the garage in ndeeba  so we met and talked about pricing'),
(7618, '2024-04-22 16:24:41', 50, 2, 0, 3, 'DENOVO BAKERY Mr Lukwago had returned to office this week so i called him to ask to meet him and he said we can meet tomorrow and see him about tyres the transport manager. \r\nTBBL/ETS RIZKA they have no need of now but Fortunate was of a view we lower our price for him so i talked to the manager  and he promised to negotiate him a better fair price. \r\nHAJJ KALULE of PYRAMID HARDWARE said he had gone to Tororo but he asked i call him tomorrow at 10;00 am to see if he will be able to come and see the tyres. \r\n\r\n'),
(7619, '2024-04-22 16:48:58', 16, 1, 0, 5, 'BABY COACHES Bought 4pcs of 315/80r22.5\r\n\r\nFULCRUM Requested for a quotation of rims 22.5 /17.5 and 205/75r15 tyre\r\n\r\nTRINITY Paid 880.000 \r\n\r\nKINKIZI TRADERS The administrator said that they do not have an order at the moment\r\n\r\nVIVA Ssalongo asked me to check on him on Wednesday 24/4/2024'),
(7620, '2024-04-22 16:48:58', 16, 2, 0, 2, 'CHINA RAILWAY Talked to Gu and he promised to meet me next week\r\n\r\nDEVIL INVESTMENTS LTD Mr. Paul said that he needs 1.00r20 20pcs soon'),
(7621, '2024-04-23 16:23:38', 16, 1, 0, 2, 'MAGANJO GRAIN MILLERS. Met Yiga'),
(7622, '2024-04-23 16:23:38', 16, 2, 0, 4, 'DOOBA ENTERPRIZES. Sent a message to James as requested because he is always busy but he has not yet replied.\r\n\r\nEVENTS LTD. Contacted Phillip. We did not talk much because he was buy but he promised to get back to me.\r\n\r\nTRINITY. Talked to Mark about more business. He promised to give us bigger business very soon.\r\n\r\nMEDECINES. Talked to David about store inspections'),
(7623, '2024-04-23 16:35:20', 50, 1, 0, 3, 'DENOVO BAKERY went to the factory but Mr Lukwago was not in office so he asked we meet when his back from the village. \r\nTEMBO MILLERS the logistics and transport manager were not in office and they asked if we can schedule another day so we left our cards i expect a meeting with them soon. \r\nPYRAMID HARDWARE went to the hardware but Hajj Kalule was in the garage and does not want to negotiate on phone so he asked if we can meet another day. '),
(7624, '2024-04-23 16:35:20', 50, 2, 0, 1, 'ETS RIZKA  got a call from Fortuante and he said he wants some tyres of 1100r24 so he asked for a price and told him a negotiated discount and promised to call when he has cash for delivery. '),
(7625, '2024-04-23 16:35:20', 50, 8, 0, 1, 'BEBETO COACHES they still do not have a sure when date to pay there debt but will keep engaged with Mr Okit daily. '),
(7626, '2024-04-24 15:55:48', 16, 1, 0, 1, '   VIVA. Ssalongo said that he will call me for cash payment . he also complained on 315/80R22.5MD that it is not good because two tyres had issues one burst and  another one had a bulge.\r\n'),
(7627, '2024-04-24 15:55:48', 16, 2, 0, 4, 'SAFARIS LTD. I tried to contact them but the number did not go through.\r\n\r\nYO KUKU. Talked to Akera though we did not talk much because he was out of Office but he promised to get back to me when he gets back.\r\n\r\n\r\nMEDECINES. Talked to David about the store inspection'),
(7628, '2024-04-24 17:44:43', 50, 1, 0, 3, 'KIWI ENTERPRISES the manager said they had just bought tyres recently but he will buy from us incase of any need hence forth. \r\nZAWADI BUSES the manager Mukasa was not in office so he said i engage the mechanic and he was okay with our prices so the mechanics promised business in case of any need soon. \r\nBISMARAKAN COACH Emma is still not positive of when to buy but will keep checking on him for business they are a good client with regular tyre need. '),
(7629, '2024-04-24 17:44:43', 50, 2, 0, 2, 'AMBAINCE DISTILLERS called Stella but she had no response so will visit her tomorrow and follow up on debt and more orders. \r\nETS RIZKA Fortunate said he has not yet got cash for the tyres he wanted but ill call me anytime he finds the money ready from his boss. '),
(7630, '2024-04-24 17:44:43', 50, 4, 0, 1, 'NTAKE BAKERY asked for a proforma for tyres of 7.00r16 in highway and mad grip'),
(7631, '2024-04-24 17:44:43', 50, 8, 0, 1, 'BEBETO COACHES they said i pass by on Friday they did not have ready cash for me. '),
(7632, '2024-04-25 17:17:33', 16, 1, 0, 3, 'KIDDA WALIME I did not see Mr. Ruka but when I contacted him. he said that currently he has no need for tyres. He therefore asked me to check on him on 30/4/2024\r\n\r\nDAFRIC LOGISTICS I didnot see Tom because he had gone to Kenya. But when I called him He said that he is coming back tomorrow to pay\r\n\r\nBABY COACHES Saalimu promised to pay tomorrow evening because we have waited for Mr. Apolo since morning promising to bring money but he has failed'),
(7633, '2024-04-25 17:17:34', 16, 2, 0, 2, 'CHINA GEO Manager Tang asked me to always send him messages as a way of checking him. He promised that when he gets requisition he will definitely call me\r\n\r\nKREM EVENTS Tried to contact Mr. Apolo but he did not pick'),
(7634, '2024-04-25 17:58:24', 50, 1, 0, 1, 'ANDYS GARAGE the boss Mr Andrew was not around so the mechanics said he will be there tomorrow so will pass by or call him. The tractor tyres he wanted are still available in stock. '),
(7635, '2024-04-25 17:58:25', 50, 2, 0, 2, 'NTAKE BAKERY the quotation we shred to Jotham has not yet been responded to we will wait until when his ready. \r\nAMBIANCE DISTILLERS also sent in an order for 265/60R18 one piece. and she promised to get us some cheques on the debts. '),
(7636, '2024-04-25 17:58:25', 50, 3, 0, 1, 'AMBAINCE DISTILLERS they bought one tyre of 265/60R18 '),
(7637, '2024-04-26 17:38:39', 50, 1, 0, 1, 'BEBETO COACHES to get money they paid 1'),
(7638, '2024-04-26 17:38:39', 50, 3, 0, 1, 'AMBIANCE DISTILLERS they bought three pieces of 9.5R17.5 '),
(7639, '2024-04-26 18:03:26', 16, 1, 0, 1, 'PAMOJA TOURS Wants 285/75r16'),
(7640, '2024-04-26 18:03:26', 16, 2, 0, 6, 'VITAFOAM The cheque is ready. we might get it tommorrow if he comes to town. but if he fails  the delivery van will bring it on Monday\r\n\r\nELLINGTON will call me\r\n\r\nPIN TRAVEL He told me to wait until his car is ready to go out of the garage\r\n\r\nTAHFEEZ Musa was not picking\r\n\r\nWILD HAVEN The tyres are qood and he will buy more in the near future\r\n\r\nCHINA GEO wants a quotation for tube 23.1/26'),
