(7660, '2024-04-29 17:01:39', 50, 2, 0, 3, 'AMBIANCE DISTILLERS Madam Stella said she wanted a tyre over the weekend so we delivered it today and checked din for a cheque for debt payment. \r\nPYRAMID HARDWARE talked to Hajj Kalule on phone and he said his travelling back to Kampala but will be here soon  in case he makes time. \r\nETS RIZKA asked Mr. Fortunate if he has any need lately and he said he does not but will be in touch incase of any need . \r\n'),
