(7698, '2024-04-29 18:06:30', 16, 1, 0, 3, 'VIVA I did not see Ssalongo at his office because he had gone for burial. I will go tomorrow\r\n\r\nBABY COAH Met Kasaija and he promised to pay tomorrow. He also said that currently they need more tyres but they want to first clear their balance to zero and then we plan on new orders\r\n\r\nKREM EVENTS Met Kamuswga he requested for the price of 265/75r16.They promised to come for aligment'),
(7699, '2024-04-29 18:06:30', 16, 2, 0, 1, 'DAFRIC Talked to Mr. Tom he said that he is back in Kampala and he promised to pay today evening'),
(7700, '2024-04-30 16:26:35', 50, 1, 0, 5, 'DENOVO BAKERY Mr Lukwago still is not willing to offer business due to some internal issue his not willing to tell me but will keep trying to get him to buy and let us supply them soon as they can purchase. He even wanted to come and make a new partnership and negotiate pricing and payment plans. \r\nNTAKE BAKERY they still seem to have no need and i asked Jotham how far with the recent quotation we sent him and he said they have not yet been allowed to make any purchases and these vehicles are being repaired. \r\nGADITH INVESTMENTS Gasta was not in office but i called him and he promised to send in any recent purchases that arise soon. He even said they have a lot of business lately for most of the trucks. \r\nANDYS TRACTORS AND GARAGE the boss Andrew was not in office but his mechanics said they have few tractor works lately and incase need arises they will send it in because most of the tractors have no tyres of late they are worn out. \r\nELIANA SCHOOLS they still have no need and got holidays few days ago but the headteacher said he will contact us when they open next term. \r\n\r\n'),
(7701, '2024-04-30 16:26:36', 50, 2, 0, 2, 'BEBETO COACHES to follow up on the debt payment as they had promised but they had no response so will try them tomorrow as they requested. Also they had asked for 13R22.5 but they can not buy the mud grip tyres we have. \r\nHAJJ KALULE of PYRAMID HARDWARE KAWEMPE he still is failing to make time but said he will just send in an order to buy from us soon. Its a promising account because they have trailers that travel a lot countrywide. '),
(7702, '2024-04-30 16:26:36', 50, 13, 0, 1, 'AMBIANCE DISTILLERS wanted Tyres of 9.5R17.5 and 265/70R19.5 mud grip but we did not have them so they called it off. '),
(7703, '2024-04-30 16:26:46', 16, 1, 0, 3, 'HUITONG. Met mr. Peng. He said he will give us business as soon as they finish setting up their business.\r\n\r\nCRSG. Met mr. GU'),
(7704, '2024-04-30 16:26:46', 16, 2, 0, 2, 'DAFRIC . Talked to Tom and he promised to pay this week not exceeding friday.\r\n\r\nFULCRUM'),
(7705, '2024-05-01 16:24:27', 16, 1, 0, 1, 'DOOBA ENTERPRIZES. Talked to James'),
(7706, '2024-05-01 16:24:28', 16, 2, 0, 5, 'NOOR LOGISTICS. Contacted Haji Muhamad. He said that he is going to sit and go through company details and he asked me to check on him next week on tuesday.\r\n\r\nCHINAWU YI CO. Contacted Cate the HR to give me update about the procurement manager but unfortunately she did not pick. but I will try her tomorrow.\r\n\r\nZINDA TRANSPORTERS. Bought 4pcs of 195/70R14 \r\n\r\nVIVA . Brought 2tyres of 315/80R22.5 for fitting.\r\n\r\nBABY COACH . Kasaija promised to pay.'),
(7707, '2024-05-01 16:24:28', 16, 3, 0, 2, 'VIVA\r\nZINDA TRANSPORTERS'),
(7708, '2024-05-01 16:24:28', 16, 4, 0, 1, '195/70R14 '),
(7709, '2024-05-01 16:24:28', 16, 10, 0, 6, '4ocs 195/70R14 \r\n2pcs 315/80R22.5 fitting'),
(7710, '2024-05-01 16:24:28', 16, 14, 0, 3, 'ZINDA\r\nVIVA\r\nBABY COACH'),
(7711, '2024-05-01 16:34:30', 50, 1, 0, 2, 'AMBIANCE DISTILLERS for monetary collections and they did not have the cheques ready so will try again this week. Madam Stella also promised an order in a few days \r\nGADITH INVESTMENTS i tried waiting for Mr Gasta as we had agreed to meet and he later arrived but we talked about resuming business with them and his positive. '),
(7712, '2024-05-02 16:26:54', 50, 1, 0, 2, 'BEBETO COACHES they called me to meet the boss and discuss the new tyres sizes they wanted and pricing. But he did not agree to it will wait for further response from him soon. \r\nELIANA AGENCIES they are an old customer account that i tried to call and the manager was in office so we met and he had some grievances with the old account handler but sorted that and he promised business soon. '),
(7713, '2024-05-02 16:26:54', 50, 2, 0, 1, 'TUWEERZA BAKERY ENTERPRISES called them to get to know why they do not buy from us anymore and they had no reason but asked if i can make a visit and talk more and the lady agreed so will attend to them on Monday next week '),
(7714, '2024-05-02 16:59:54', 16, 1, 0, 1, 'NICEFOAM.  Met Reymond the transport manager. He promised business and asked for the price list and tax exemption certificate.\r\n\r\nBABY COACH. Apolo said that things have been tough but promised Kasaija to pick money tomorrow.'),
(7715, '2024-05-02 16:59:54', 16, 2, 0, 3, 'ROKO. Talked to Bakka about payment terms that they have to present proof of payment before delivery and he said  that he will give me feedback from transport department.\r\n\r\nJIKO. Contacted Yiga about tyres  for lightbut he has not given me feedback yet.\r\n\r\nCHINA WUYI CO. Talked to madam Cate and she said that the transport manager is still in China I have to wait for him to come back.'),
(7716, '2024-05-03 18:22:41', 16, 1, 0, 2, 'VITAFOAM. Paid 7'),
(7717, '2024-05-03 18:22:41', 16, 2, 0, 1, 'ELLINGTON SAFARIS. Contacted m\r\nShon but he did not answer'),
(7718, '2024-05-06 17:39:37', 50, 1, 0, 1, 'TUWEREZA ENTERPRISE AND BAKERY the boss madam Sarah wants to buy but she had issues and complaints from the recent handler who used to sell to them for our company and this affected our company image towards her but she will engage me when she needs our services soon as she said that they have no stable supplier for tyres. She also was not okay with some prices because they do not meet the ones on market. '),
(7719, '2024-05-06 17:39:37', 50, 2, 0, 3, 'BEBETO CAOCHES to recover some money \r\nELIANA AGENCY they are not yet in any  need as for now. \r\nGRAIN BULKERS also have no business now since all trucks are parked for a month now. '),
(7720, '2024-05-06 18:08:07', 16, 1, 0, 4, 'GOAL UG. Met the receptionist and she told me that they have finished the prequalification process and asked me to check on them after three years.\r\n\r\nMEDECINS. Met David and asked me to check on him on friday.\r\n\r\nDAFRIC. Tom promised to pay soon. he said that the money has not reflected on their account yet.\r\n\r\nTAHFEEZE. The person Imet asked me totalk to the boss and gave me his contact but when i contacted him'),
(7721, '2024-05-06 18:08:07', 16, 2, 0, 1, 'DEWIL. Talked to matovu and he promised to come next week for 1400 tyres.'),
(7722, '2024-05-07 16:21:42', 50, 1, 0, 3, 'TEMBO MILLERS the logistics officer made a few remarks and concerns with our prices and brands we sell. So he was promising and he said we keep in touch for some trucks and it was quite a number i saw with him. he will send in a quotation when they need to restock soon. \r\nDENOVO BAKERY Lukwago still ahs no trucks that need tyres and the ones he needed for 165r13c but the price sent him off and called off the order but he will send in soon for 7.00R15 in a few days \r\nNEWMANS they are a snack factory with a lot of small vehicles that distribute and the manager was okay to offer us business we exchanged contacts and will keep up with them to do business with them. '),
(7723, '2024-05-07 17:32:17', 16, 1, 0, 3, 'TRINITY Met Mark. He promised to give me business tomorrow for 315/80r22.5 12pcs. He promised to call anytime tomorrow\r\n\r\nFULCRUM Talked to Mugabe about the quotation of rims and tyres. He said that they are waiting for their engineer to come back and he promised to call when he comes because he is the one to fit them.\r\n\r\nPIN TRAVEL Met Mr. Kavulu and he promised to call me as soon as they get business because currently they do not have any business and their cars are parked at office'),
(7724, '2024-05-07 17:32:17', 16, 2, 0, 2, 'NOOR LOGISITCS Talked to Hajji the director. He had requested for 15.5r25 2pcs but he cancelled the request due to price difference ours was at 3.340.000 tax inclusive higher than city tyres BKT 2.100.000\r\n\r\nSTANDARD SAFARIS Tried to contact them but they did not answer. I will therefore try to locate them'),
(7725, '2024-05-08 17:27:41', 50, 1, 0, 3, 'BEBETO COACHES i had a meeting with the accountant and boss of the company to discuss the debt payment plan because its overdue and beyond. They suggested they will keep paying gradually but will increase the amount they pay to over a million. \r\nGRAIN BULKERS met Mr. Imran and he was still not sure of the need since the trucks have all been stranded due to some issues so we will keep trying to follow.\r\nMPA HARDWARE  in nakulabye they have a few trucks and trailers but they had concerns on prices so will try making more engagements and get business so that we can negotiate when they need any Tyres purchase. \r\n'),
(7726, '2024-05-09 16:11:38', 50, 1, 0, 3, 'AMBIANCE DISTILLERS met with Stella to check in why they do not send in any orders lately but she said schools are closed and all drones are parked. But she ahs a few trucks doing company deliveries so she will be buying some truck tyres slowly she even ordered for 9.5R17.5 two tyres. she also promised to follow up on some cheques for us. \r\nZAWADI COACHES the manager claims they have a supplier but the boss is still skeptical of the supplier since they have always had issues with the tyres. So they will keep engaging and give me a response if they can start buying from us soon.\r\nNILE STAR COACHES the manager had travelled to Arua for some issues but he called and promised to come back and meet me. \r\n'),
(7727, '2024-05-09 16:11:38', 50, 2, 0, 2, 'BEBETO COACHES there company head of operations called me and promised to be in touch and follow up on the debt payment to increase the installment payment. They also want to get them tyres of 13r22.5 but it will all be after payment of the pending debt. \r\nKENROM CHEMICALS they ordered for a tyre of 315/80r22.5 and they also want to follow up the debt payment too. '),
(7728, '2024-05-09 16:11:38', 50, 3, 0, 1, 'AMBIANCE DISTILELRS bought two tyres of 9.5r17.5'),
(7729, '2024-05-09 17:50:40', 16, 1, 0, 3, 'BABY COACH. Mr. Apolo promised to pay tomorrow. and requested for quality improvement.\r\n\r\nNICEFOAM. I did not see Reymond as expected because he was so busy with the boss. but i hope to see him later.\r\n\r\nPEC. Met Mr. Kitumba and he promised big business as soon as their Bliisa project starts.'),
(7730, '2024-05-09 17:50:41', 16, 2, 0, 3, 'ADVENTURE SAFARIS. The director promised to give me business in June and July. That is when he expects business.\r\n\r\nFULCRUM. Mugabe came and saw the rims'),
(7731, '2024-05-10 15:24:52', 16, 1, 0, 1, 'BABY COACH. Apolo paid 1'),
(7732, '2024-05-10 15:24:52', 16, 2, 0, 2, 'TAHFEEZE. Contacted Mr. Maganjo but he did not pick up.\r\n\r\nELLY SERVICE STATION. Mr. Kafiifi asked for the price of 23.1 R26 2pcs'),
(7733, '2024-05-10 17:12:03', 50, 3, 0, 1, 'KENROM CHEMICALS they bought one tyre of 315/80R22.5 mad gip.'),
(7734, '2024-05-13 17:42:24', 16, 2, 0, 3, 'VIVA. Deposited 5million by cheque.\r\n\r\nKIIWA HARDWARE. Kiiwa Junior asked me to go and meet him with his Father ie the boss'),
(7735, '2024-05-13 17:49:18', 50, 2, 0, 3, 'PYRAMID HARDWARE hajj Kalule is still not easy to meet in office his always outside raveling but we will keep following up on him. \r\nBEBETO COACHES they had to pay today some money but they did not and asked me to go visit them tomorrow to get some money. \r\nNTAKE BAKERY the old quotation we made  for them they still ave issues to buy though Jotham is promising. '),
(7736, '2024-05-14 17:20:08', 16, 2, 0, 3, 'FULCRUM. Mr. Mugabe requested for a discount on 22.5Rims. He wanted to pay 300'),
(7737, '2024-05-14 18:01:00', 50, 1, 0, 1, 'BEBETO COACHES the boss says he was not contented with our Tyres and how we handled the tyre issue of spoilt tyres. He insists he will pay the debt to zero balance but wont buy from us again '),
(7738, '2024-05-14 18:01:00', 50, 2, 0, 1, 'PYRAMID HARDWARE hajj kalule said he will need 10 tyres of 315/80R22.5 h/w but willcome to office and buy from us but will need to get a better price rate. '),
(7739, '2024-05-15 16:11:07', 16, 1, 0, 2, 'KIWA GENERAL HARDWARE. Met Kiwa and we held business discussion. He requested to buy 315/80R22.5 at 800'),
(7740, '2024-05-15 17:25:16', 50, 1, 0, 2, 'KM INVESTMENTS met Mr. Ibra but they have no need now and they wanted batteries but we dont sell them so he said he has a truck coming soon he will see if it needs any Tyres but we dont have them in stock\r\nDENOVO BAKERY the transport manager still is not willing to meet and talk i failed to get to him again but will keep trying them. \r\n'),
(7741, '2024-05-16 17:02:18', 16, 1, 0, 2, 'ERRIMAT INDUSTRIES. Met Reymond and he orderd for 2 pcs of 265/7019.5 HW and 4pcs of 700R16 MD.\r\n\r\nTRINITY. I did not see Mark but I was told that he is transfered to Rwanda. therefore'),
(7742, '2024-05-16 17:02:18', 16, 2, 0, 2, 'DEWILL INVESTMENTS. Matovu ordered for 1000R20 10pcs to be deliverd tomorrow.\r\n\r\nKAI AFRO MILLERS. Edward promised to give an order for 31x10.5 R15 soon.\r\n'),
(7743, '2024-05-16 17:02:18', 16, 3, 0, 2, '265/70R19.5HW\r\n\r\n700R16 MD'),
(7744, '2024-05-16 17:02:18', 16, 4, 0, 2, '265/70R19.5HW 2pcs\r\n\r\n700R16 MD 4pcs'),
(7745, '2024-05-16 17:02:18', 16, 5, 0, 1, 'KAI AFRO MILLERS'),
(7746, '2024-05-16 17:02:18', 16, 10, 0, 6, '265/70R19.5HW 2pcs\r\n\r\n700R16 MD 4pcs'),
(7747, '2024-05-16 18:05:33', 50, 1, 0, 1, 'ZAWADI BUSES the person in charge of buying is still off but he will be in office next week and will visit him though the whole team is convincing to buy from us soon '),
(7748, '2024-05-16 18:05:33', 50, 2, 0, 1, 'ETS RIZKA  Mr Fortunate asked for prices of 13R22.5 and he will be in touch so he will continue '),
(7749, '2024-05-16 18:05:33', 50, 3, 0, 2, 'PYRAMID HARDWARE Hajj Kalule bought some tyres of 315/80R22.5 8 tyres and he was pleased with the quality \r\nNTAKE BAKERY they also bought 11r22.5 of 4 tyres today but have no response from the past quotation. '),
(7750, '2024-05-20 17:03:20', 16, 1, 0, 3, 'KREM EVENTS. I went to meet the director for business but he was not there. and the person I found told me that the director will come back on friday. Therefore I will make another plan to  meet him.\r\n\r\nBABY COACH. I went to Arua park to collect money but  the General Manager asked me to go back tomorrow morning for payment because today they had so many suppliers to clear.\r\n\r\n\r\nMOVIT. Met Brian for busines. He referred me to Mr. Ssenfuma who does purchase for tyres. Therefore I will plan and go there to meet them next week on monday.'),
(7751, '2024-05-20 17:03:21', 16, 2, 0, 1, 'CHINA GEO. I contacted manager Tang for more business. He said that currently they do not have any need for tyre but he promised to call me for orders as usual.\r\n\r\n\r\nNAKASEKE MEDICAL CENTER. I contacted Mr. Ntumwa for land cruiser tyres.  He said that they will come for inspection as soon as he comes back to Uganda.\r\n\r\nCHEAP HARDWARE. I contacted Mr. Steve for business. Heasked me to go and meet the director tomorrow morning because he is the decision maker.'),
(7752, '2024-05-20 17:27:39', 50, 1, 0, 2, 'AMBIANCE DISTILLERS  the transport manager Stella was out of office to masaka she will let me know if cheques are ready for picking up soon. Will check on her on Wednesday.\r\nANDYS GARAGE  i met mr Andrew for business and he was not willing to buy our tyres because of prices so he will get another supplier but he is still open minded if we can lower our prices. '),
(7753, '2024-05-20 17:27:39', 50, 2, 0, 1, 'BEBETO COACHES the CFO was not in office so they will pay when his back to office. '),
(7754, '2024-05-20 17:27:39', 50, 4, 0, 1, 'NTAKE BAKERY they sent an order for 295/80R22.5 but it was not fulfilled due to low funds and stock is not in for that tyre. I hope the order will be looked into tomorrow '),
(7755, '2024-05-21 17:16:17', 50, 1, 0, 6, 'DENOVO BAKERY Lukwago said he still has an issue making a proposal to his boss to change a supplier but he has had a hard time doing so. I requested him to meet gain so i can meet him with the  manager and he as okay with it so will meet on Friday as he said. This is a promising account if we get it they have many delivery trucks that can take tyres of light trucks. \r\nNEWMANS the are producer company of edibles and distribute around town they have many vehicles like drones and trucks. The procurement officer said she ahs no problem offering business so she took a pricelist and promised to buy soon. She also asked if we can offer debt periods and she was okay with the offers i made so i hope for good results from the meeting. \r\nBUKOOLA CHEMICALS the manager was not in office so we will meet on Friday after scheduling on phone. He then asked if we made up our minds on changing prices to there suitable ones. Will need help from the manager to get this deal done. \r\nGADITH INVESTMENTS i went to the site and met Gasta but he still isnt being open on whether to offer business or not. This was because he seemed t have another supplier giving him tyres and some incentives'),
(7756, '2024-05-21 17:16:17', 50, 3, 0, 1, 'NTAKE BAKERY they bought 3 tyres of 295/80r22.5 but Jotham was not happy with how we delayed the order since it was urgent. '),
(7757, '2024-05-21 18:25:33', 16, 1, 0, 5, 'BABY COACH. I went to collect money. they paid 1.800.000.\r\n\r\nCHEAP HARDWARE. I went to ask for tyre business. the director got interested in 315/80R22.5 and he promised to get back to me.\r\n\r\nE LINK WORLD SAFARIS. To ask tyres for business of  land cruiser tyres. The manager accepted to suport us when need arises.\r\n\r\nMUKISA MPEWO HARD WARE. To ask for 315/80R22.5 business. Tonny decided to give us 700R16 instead.\r\n\r\nMAGEMBE HARDWARE. I went to meet Mrs magembe for business. She promised to give us 700R16 business.\r\n\r\n'),
(7758, '2024-05-21 18:25:34', 16, 2, 0, 3, 'DEWIL INVESTMENTS LTD. Mr. Matovu ordered for 1000R20 Ipc. But unfortunately we did not deliver due to the wrong stock information in the system which was showing that we have 1pc yet it was completely out of stock\r\n\r\nPAN AFRICAN TANSPORT. They odered for 16pcs of 1200R24. Manager simon said that we sha have a brief meeting tomorrow mornig about that.'),
(7759, '2024-05-21 18:25:34', 16, 3, 0, 1, 'uganda today tours and travel'),
(7760, '2024-05-22 16:39:36', 50, 1, 0, 5, 'IVANOS LOGISTICS I went to their offices and Julius shared the number of the mechanic so i got in touch with the mechanic to get to know the need he told me all trucks are under mechanical siege and will be on the road in a few weeks. Will stay in check with him soi can supply them soon. \r\nKIWI ENTERPRISES the manager was of a point that they still have tyres on each truck and will let me if he can offer us business if his boss agrees to making us the new supplier to there company. They asked me to continuously check up on them. \r\nMOTHERCARE SCHOOLS they are opening up on Monday so i visited Gerald'),
(7761, '2024-05-22 16:39:36', 50, 2, 0, 2, 'AMBAINCE DISTILLERS called Stella to check on progress with cheques and she said we can pick them so i asked the accounts team to assist me being that i was far. \r\nNEWMANS SNACKS called the manager to get a day to meet again as he asked and asked for Monday. '),
(7762, '2024-05-22 17:15:47', 16, 1, 0, 5, 'PAN AFRIC IMPEX.To agree on payment terms. They agreed to pay within 45 days with a PDC.\r\n\r\nMPA HARDWARE. I met Mr. Hilary and he agreed to buy 315/80R22.5 very soon.\r\n\r\nZION HARDWARE.  To look for business. The director was not seen but I received her number . I will call her for appointment.\r\n\r\nKO HINOOR INVESTMENTS LTD. TO look for business. No business there because they import tyres directly.\r\n\r\nTRINITY. To meet the new manager and ask him business. The manager was seen and he promised business when need arises.'),
(7763, '2024-05-22 17:15:47', 16, 2, 0, 2, 'DEWIL INVESTMENTS. To find out whether they still need there order for 10.00R20 . Mr. Matovu confirmed that they are still waiting for the order.\r\n\r\nSIGHTSAVERS. Contacted Tabitha about their state on tyres. but she did not pick.'),
(7764, '2024-05-22 17:15:47', 16, 3, 0, 2022, ''),
(7765, '2024-05-23 16:41:00', 50, 1, 0, 4, 'MILDMAY UGANDA met Ivan and he was not aware of our tyre brands'),
(7766, '2024-05-23 16:41:00', 50, 3, 0, 2, 'AMBIANCE DISTILLERS they bought 21/75r15 2 tyres and 195r15c 2 tyres\r\nNTAKE BAKERY bought 10 tyres of 9.5r17.5 '),
(7767, '2024-05-23 16:41:01', 50, 4, 0, 1, 'KENROM CHEMICALS they wanted 185r15lt at 180'),
(7768, '2024-05-24 17:26:11', 50, 1, 0, 3, 'SPRINT PAPERS met with Kaweesi the manager of fleet so he was okay with some prices  but i asked him to be sure of negotiation incase of business. Will stay in touch to follow up on him.\r\nLIGHT ACADEMY the headteacher met with some drivers and they had no problem if the tyres are well priced and they also want service and wheel alignment. \r\nANDYS GARAGE they wanted to buy but instead they asked to postpone the purchase and will buy later this month. '),
(7769, '2024-05-24 17:26:11', 50, 2, 0, 1, 'NEWMANS SNACKS the manager said he will present it to his boss when she is in office soon will follow up next week. '),
(7770, '2024-05-24 18:24:37', 16, 1, 0, 4, 'YOKUKU After July I met Akera the fleet manager. He welcomed my proposal. He asked me to check on them in August first week for consideration when of our products\r\n\r\nERRI GENERAL HARDWARE LTD Bought 2pcs of 315/80r22.5\r\n\r\nVIVA I met Ssalongo and gave me 2cheques to clear their balance\r\n\r\nDAFRIC I had gone to ask for more business but Gerald told me that Tom the manager back next week any day so i will go back to meet him next week'),
(7771, '2024-05-24 18:24:37', 16, 2, 0, 2, 'DEWIL INVESTMENTS LTD Bought 4pcs of 245/70r16\r\n\r\nKREM Ordered for 9.5r17.5 2pcs and 195r15 4pcs'),
(7772, '2024-05-27 17:45:17', 16, 1, 0, 2, 'VIVA He promised to buy 5pcs of 700r15\r\n\r\nKREM EVENTS He paid 3.540.000'),
(7773, '2024-05-27 17:45:17', 16, 8, 0, 1, '3.540.000'),
(7774, '2024-05-27 17:50:26', 50, 1, 0, 5, 'NTAKE BAKERY they have no orders pending supply but Jotham is sure he will have one soon for mbale branch. He requested for consistency in supply because he does not want orders to go to other companies. \r\nIVANOS LOGISTICS went to see Martha and she told me the trailers are still under maintenance but will be ready soon for orders. I further went to the garage to engage the mechanics who were sure soon they will  be ready. \r\nHOME PRIDE BAKERY i met with the transport manager but he was not sure if he will offer business but his still open to negotiations. They are no longer under procurement of Ntake so they will be making independent orders. \r\nAMBIANCE DISTILLERS they sent in a vehicle on Saturday but Stella said they will be more since the school opened up again. The vans are back on the road so she will keep me posted. \r\nTUWEREZA BAKERY they seem to still not to be sure of giving us business'),
(7775, '2024-05-27 17:50:26', 50, 2, 0, 1, 'BEBETO COACHES they are not responding to the payment as they agreed to pay weekly. '),
(7776, '2024-05-28 17:54:46', 50, 1, 0, 4, 'NEWMANS SNACKS the manager said he is still trying to get us to the supply contract and now he promised to be patient for this to go through. \r\nhe wanted some tyres of 215/75r15 thats the size they use commonly . \r\nMOTHERCARE SCHOOLS they bought a new vehicle so Gerald asked me to kep checking on him to make sure he keeps posted when to buy the tyres. Will follow up daily closely so that we close the sale. for  195r15c\r\nIVANOS LOGISTICS the repair of the  trailer was done and they offered to call me incase need arises today evening for 315/70R22.5 \r\nMUWAWU MIXED FARM they have sme trucks and tractors. Muwawu said we will meet again and i have a proposal to supply his fleet tyres. '),
(7777, '2024-05-28 17:54:46', 50, 4, 0, 1, '315/80R22.5 for IVANOS LOGISTICS URGENTLY 12TYRES TOMMOROW'),
(7778, '2024-05-28 18:43:01', 16, 1, 0, 3, 'KAMRAS TRADING COMPANY LIMITED Wants 5pcs of 700r15\r\n\r\nGANATRAC PLANT wants 12.5/80r18\r\n\r\nElly service station wants 23.1 r 16'),
(7779, '2024-05-29 16:15:47', 16, 1, 0, 2, 'DOOBA. Talked to James about tyres and he promised to come for 185r14c for his probox.\r\n\r\n\r\nOTENGELO ENGINEERING LTD. Bought 2 pcs of 12.5/80.18.'),
(7780, '2024-05-29 16:15:47', 16, 2, 0, 3, 'ZINDA TRANSPORTERS. Bought 3pcs of 265/70r19.5.\r\n\r\nCHEAP HARDWARE. Talke to Ason about appointment and he asked me to check on him on monday.\r\n\r\nNAMUYOMBA IVESTMENTS. Bashir promised to come for 205/80r15 next month.'),
(7781, '2024-05-29 16:15:47', 16, 3, 0, 2, '12.5/80.18\r\n\r\n265/70r19.5.'),
(7782, '2024-05-29 16:15:47', 16, 4, 0, 2, ''),
(7783, '2024-05-29 16:15:47', 16, 10, 0, 5, '265/70r19.5.\r\n\r\n12.5/80.18'),
(7784, '2024-05-29 18:24:41', 50, 1, 0, 4, 'ANDYS TRACTORS they still are not sure when to buy due to smoe issues and they will contact me this week.\r\nMUWAWU FARM the tractors are still fine for now will wait for truck Tyres. \r\nIVANOS LOGISTICS the order for 315 was not delivered so had to see Mr Juluis and talk to him. \r\nBEBETO COACHES went with the accountant to get a way forward with the debt and they areed to weekly paymnets and had some internal issues lately. '),
(7785, '2024-05-29 18:24:41', 50, 4, 0, 1, 'NTAKE ABKERY ORDER QUOATTION FOR 315/80R22.5 ');
INSERT INTO `checklist_response` (`checklist_response_id`, `date`, `user_id`, `checklist_id`, `client_id`, `value`, `narration`) VALUES
(7786, '2024-05-30 17:21:10', 50, 1, 0, 5, 'LANDMARK SCHOOLS they wanted to get a day and bring in the buses for Tyre fitting and buy 7.00-15 They said they will come next week. \r\nKYELIMA HARDWARE the manager was out of office and asked we meet another time probably next week Tuesday. \r\nMOTHERCARE SCHOOLS'),
(7787, '2024-05-30 17:21:10', 50, 2, 0, 2, 'BEYOND LOGISTICS they are a company with a big fleet so will meet the manager next week if he has time as he said. \r\nDEPENDABLE OUTCOMES in namasuba they have a lot of tractors for hire and contractor jobs the logistics officer said i will see him tomorrow and talk to his boss. '),
(7788, '2024-05-30 17:54:27', 16, 1, 0, 3, 'KAMRAS Ordered 5pcs of 700r15\r\n\r\nMPRODUCTS Met Luzinda and he promised to give me business soon. I also expect quick feedback from Vicent tomorrow from his boss\r\n\r\nLUGAYAVU HARDWARE '),
(7789, '2024-05-30 17:54:27', 16, 2, 0, 2, 'DOOBA James called and asked me to meet him on Tuesday next week in the morning\r\n\r\nCRSG I checked on Mr. Gu about 1400tyres. He promised to give me order after June'),
(7790, '2024-05-31 17:52:11', 16, 1, 0, 3, 'NAMUYOMBA INVESTMENTS Bashir is going to come for 205/70R15 bearway on Friday\r\nBABY COACH Kasija promised to buy 315/80R22.5 when we get stock\r\nONTENGELLO LTD  PROMISED To buy 1400 very soon'),
(7791, '2024-05-31 17:52:12', 16, 2, 0, 2, 'MUKISA MPEWO talked to Tonny he promised to come for 700R15 soon\r\nKAPIL HARDWARE Talked to the manager and he promised to give me 315/80R22.5'),
(7792, '2024-06-04 16:53:13', 16, 2, 0, 5, 'NAMUYOMBA INVESTMENTS. Bashir promised to come for 205/70R15 soon.\r\n\r\nVIVA. Paid 5 million. \r\n\r\nMULUNGU SAFARIS. I talked to Juma and he asked me to meet them tomorrow.\r\n\r\nPIN TRAVEL. Kavulu said that he is going to come soon.\r\n\r\nDOOBA . James asked me to call him tomorrow morning.'),
(7793, '2024-06-04 17:17:35', 50, 1, 0, 4, 'KYELIMA HARDWARE'),
(7794, '2024-06-05 16:29:52', 50, 1, 0, 4, 'DBG TRACTORS the manager wants us to negotiate a debt period before  can introduce us to his boss to make us their suppliers and pay a visit here to see our store and tyre designs. He asked me to get back to him on Monday. \r\nBEYOND LOGISTICS the procurement officer promised to let me know when to prepare a bid to the company for supply so that they can offer business being that it is the only way they can let us supply them. She further asked me to share company profiles which i did and she shared contacts. We will keep following up on them. \r\nSHAKBAH INVESTMENTS they have some trucks'),
(7795, '2024-06-05 18:03:55', 16, 1, 0, 5, 'UWL SAFARIS Met the head of operations. the finance manager and transport manager. They decided to come tommorow to see 235/85r16.\r\n\r\nMILD CARE Met Hannington. He promised to give me feedback after a discussion with his boss soon\r\n\r\nBLD Met with Bashil assistant fleet manager. He asked me about 1400. He promised a quick feedback about grader tyres\r\n\r\nSAYONA HARDWARE Met Sayona promised 315/80r22.5 business soon. \r\n\r\nHAWE HARDWARE Met the manager. She promised to give me business soon for 215/75r15'),
(7796, '2024-06-05 18:03:56', 16, 2, 0, 1, 'DOOBA James postponed the appointment because their vehicle got an accident and he is the one to sort it out. I will check on him tomorrow'),
(7797, '2024-06-06 17:31:47', 50, 1, 0, 3, 'VICTORY TEANSPORTES promised business soon\r\n\r\nAQUA COOLERS They also promised business soon\r\n\r\nKM INVESMENTS The procurement manager was not in office but we rescheduled to meet Tomorrow\r\n\r\n '),
(7798, '2024-06-06 17:51:47', 16, 1, 0, 4, 'ZHANGZ He said he will give me feedback on Monday evening on how to supply them tyres\r\n\r\nVANDO INVESTMENTS They are going to send me the number of the right person i should talk to who is in Kampala because they are in Mbarara. I will talk to him after they give it to me.\r\n\r\nMAMBO HARDWARE the boss told me to go there tomorrow to discuss business\r\n\r\nUGANDA WORLD SAFARIS He was not able to come his bosses had called him at the office'),
(7799, '2024-06-06 17:51:47', 16, 2, 0, 1, 'MOPHAS SAFARIS his phone was switched off'),
(7800, '2024-06-07 15:48:41', 50, 1, 0, 3, 'KM INVESTMENTS Ibra told me in a meeting we had that they still have not yet decided but he will buy soon. He opted for debt but i rather told him to make cash payment since itS the first round due to the fact that stock for 315 is still out. \r\nDEPENDABLE OUTCOMES the chief engineer told me to check on him tomorrow either by call or visit so we can finalize on some more decisions and terms before they offer any business. \r\nwill surely visit him mid-morning.\r\nAPEX FACTORY the manager Mr. Lim said the whole fleet had just got new supply of tyres unless if any urgent need arises'),
(7801, '2024-06-07 15:48:41', 50, 2, 0, 1, 'OXEN ENGINEERING COMPANY the procurement officer asked to meet next week so we can discuss terms of payment'),
(7802, '2024-06-07 16:14:17', 16, 1, 0, 5, 'ROTAM Met Isaac and promised immediate feedback for business\r\n\r\nMAMBO HARDWARE Met Ssmambo. He promised business of 315/80r22.5. 700r16 and 265/70r19.5 very soon\r\n\r\nNAMUYOMBA INVESTMENTS Bashil promised to come for 11r soon\r\n\r\nUWL SAFARIS They chose 235/85r16 they are expected to come soon in this month\r\n\r\nMUNYONYO HARDWARE Mzee promised business for 700r15 soon'),
(7803, '2024-06-07 16:14:17', 16, 2, 0, 3, 'VIVA Deposited 5.000.000\r\n\r\nKOOKSY ICECREAM Beepin promised business for 750r16\r\n\r\nVITAFOAM Balaji promised to pay on Monday'),
(7804, '2024-06-07 16:14:17', 16, 8, 0, 1, '5.000.000'),
(7805, '2024-06-07 16:14:17', 16, 9, 0, 4, 'office\r\nmunyonyo\r\nnabbingo\r\noffice'),
(7806, '2024-06-08 16:51:32', 50, 1, 0, 1, 'DEPENDABLE OUTCOMES talked to the engineer but he was on site and busy and said i see him on Monday for business.He wants 13.00-20 '),
(7807, '2024-06-08 16:51:32', 50, 8, 0, 1, 'BEBETO COACHES paid a deposit of 500'),
(7808, '2024-06-10 16:10:06', 16, 1, 0, 5, 'MPRODUCTS. Talked to Ronald. He promised to come for 185R14C.\r\n\r\nVITAFOAM. Met Serestino. He asked me to pick the cheque on wednesday.\r\n\r\nNILEPLY. Met Charles. He gave me the number for the purchasing officer and asked me to contact him on monday.\r\n\r\n\r\nJCRC. I received the prequalification letter. They also requested for 275/70R16 prive quote.\r\n\r\nTRONIC. Bought 2pcs of 185/70R14'),
(7809, '2024-06-10 16:10:06', 16, 2, 0, 3, 'ICC. The number for Mr. Busuulwa was not availabe. I will try him on monday next week.\r\n\r\nCHINA RAILWAY. Icontacted GU. He asked me to chech on him tomorrow because today he was in a meeting.\r\n\r\n\r\nDAFRIC. Bought 1pc of 295/80R22.5.'),
(7810, '2024-06-10 16:10:06', 16, 3, 0, 2, '2pcs of 185/70R14\r\n\r\n1pc of 295/80R22.5.'),
(7811, '2024-06-10 16:10:06', 16, 4, 0, 2, '2pcs of 185/70R14\r\n\r\n1pc of 295/80R22.5.'),
