(8050, '2024-10-28 16:31:00', 60, 1, 0, 3, 'YY COACHES.The manager still told me the director is still upcountry.\nNILE COACHES. The manager promised some business.\nTAUSI COACHES.I met the assistant manager but he told me its the manager himself who handles all matters concerning tyres but unfortunately the manager was not around.'),
